(1113352, 137209, 6804, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Stunning arches. The bright color of this really makes it stand out from the rest of the challenge (so far).  If I had to make an adjustment to this one it would be add a dash of contrast and just a pinch more USM.  But it''s a 10 from me as it is.</td>', 'WOW!  Stunning arches. The bright color of this really makes it stand out from the rest of the challenge (so far).  If I had to make an adjustment to this one it would be add a dash of contrast and just a pinch more USM.  But it''s a 10 from me as it is.', '2005-01-17 00:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
