(1113815, 136760, 19952, '<td valign="top">The thing I like best about this shot is that you included the trees for perspective. Without them, this would probably be just an average shot. But with them, the photo really shows the size of the spheres. I''m sure you already knew that, but I''m just saying that I like what you did. :-)</td>', 'The thing I like best about this shot is that you included the trees for perspective. Without them, this would probably be just an average shot. But with them, the photo really shows the size of the spheres. I''m sure you already knew that, but I''m just saying that I like what you did. :-)', '2005-01-17 06:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
