(1115351, 136598, 2158, '<td valign="top">This is a great sky picture, but I wouldn''t count it as architecture shown at this size.  Maybe a large print would give a different impression.</td>', 'This is a great sky picture, but I wouldn''t count it as architecture shown at this size.  Maybe a large print would give a different impression.', '2005-01-17 18:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
