(1115551, 136699, 25742, '<td valign="top">Cool colours. In both senses of the word. Since I know the church I immediately understand the allusion, but for others I think it might be problematic. Tower slanted a bit to the R, would be better if straight. (see windows)</td>', 'Cool colours. In both senses of the word. Since I know the church I immediately understand the allusion, but for others I think it might be problematic. Tower slanted a bit to the R, would be better if straight. (see windows)', '2005-01-17 20:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
