(1115594, 136475, 17507, '<td valign="top">Great tonal range- but the hot spot in the center is very distracting. Maybe if you''d backed up a little, so it didn''t show at the peak of the arch?</td>', 'Great tonal range- but the hot spot in the center is very distracting. Maybe if you''d backed up a little, so it didn''t show at the peak of the arch?', '2005-01-17 21:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
