(1117117, 137080, 10985, '<td valign="top">Hehe... funny!</td>', 'Hehe... funny!', '2005-01-18 15:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117123, 135276, 10985, '<td valign="top">Isn''t that amazing, with all those cables. You picked the right moment for a dramatic mood!</td>', 'Isn''t that amazing, with all those cables. You picked the right moment for a dramatic mood!', '2005-01-18 15:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117126, 136994, 10985, '<td valign="top">Weird building, but a very interesting depiction of it.</td>', 'Weird building, but a very interesting depiction of it.', '2005-01-18 15:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117130, 136976, 10985, '<td valign="top">Moody and effective.</td>', 'Moody and effective.', '2005-01-18 15:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117132, 137060, 10985, '<td valign="top">Very nice B&amp;W.</td>', 'Very nice B&W.', '2005-01-18 15:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117136, 137214, 10985, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing and fascinating. The sparkle is a great plus!</td>', 'Very intriguing and fascinating. The sparkle is a great plus!', '2005-01-18 15:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117141, 136663, 10985, '<td valign="top">very nice!</td>', 'very nice!', '2005-01-18 15:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117142, 136472, 10985, '<td valign="top">Must be hot in there: no insulation in the roof! Cool little house or building. Nice angle.</td>', 'Must be hot in there: no insulation in the roof! Cool little house or building. Nice angle.', '2005-01-18 15:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117145, 136778, 10985, '<td valign="top">Where there is a hearth, there is a home...</td>', 'Where there is a hearth, there is a home...', '2005-01-18 15:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117150, 135758, 10985, '<td valign="top">Nice and clean!</td>', 'Nice and clean!', '2005-01-18 15:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117154, 136944, 10985, '<td valign="top">Great idea to rotate the image. It makes the photo althemore intriguing and interesting. Great colors and lines!</td>', 'Great idea to rotate the image. It makes the photo althemore intriguing and interesting. Great colors and lines!', '2005-01-18 15:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117156, 136656, 10985, '<td valign="top">I wonder what it looks like in the Summer! Very nice crop and light.</td>', 'I wonder what it looks like in the Summer! Very nice crop and light.', '2005-01-18 15:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117160, 136917, 10985, '<td valign="top">Nice view.</td>', 'Nice view.', '2005-01-18 15:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117163, 137059, 10985, '<td valign="top">Cool title for this challenge and very well used angle.</td>', 'Cool title for this challenge and very well used angle.', '2005-01-18 15:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117171, 136365, 10985, '<td valign="top">Very industrial. The kind of photo I would easily imagine in an Annual Report. Great colors and light.</td>', 'Very industrial. The kind of photo I would easily imagine in an Annual Report. Great colors and light.', '2005-01-18 15:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117174, 136443, 10985, '<td valign="top">Original and quite interesting. Nice toning, too.</td>', 'Original and quite interesting. Nice toning, too.', '2005-01-18 15:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117177, 135999, 10985, '<td valign="top">Very nicely seen and presented!</td>', 'Very nicely seen and presented!', '2005-01-18 15:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117191, 136912, 10985, '<td valign="top">Great title, colors, reflections and light.</td>', 'Great title, colors, reflections and light.', '2005-01-18 16:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117193, 137143, 26756, '<td valign="top">Really, really wonderful. If this had not been made of stone the effect would be so different.  Lots of elements here, the rough water, the sunset, the lines...great shot!</td>', 'Really, really wonderful. If this had not been made of stone the effect would be so different.  Lots of elements here, the rough water, the sunset, the lines...great shot!', '2005-01-18 16:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117204, 137148, 16148, '<td valign="top">This is a great find and I like this shot but have a couple of suggestions.  First, I''m not crazy about the burning around the border.  It''s very obvious and not needed.  Second, the lighting seems a bit harsh.  Maybe to much contrast?  This might have been unavoidable because of the time of day.  I''d like to see this image with softer lighting.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is a great find and I like this shot but have a couple of suggestions.  First, I''m not crazy about the burning around the border.  It''s very obvious and not needed.  Second, the lighting seems a bit harsh.  Maybe to much contrast?  This might have been unavoidable because of the time of day.  I''d like to see this image with softer lighting.  Good luck!', '2005-01-18 16:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117227, 137154, 16266, '<td valign="top">i have been really intrigued lately with reflectins in things.. this one is great.... nice spotting.</td>', 'i have been really intrigued lately with reflectins in things.. this one is great.... nice spotting.', '2005-01-18 16:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117228, 136544, 18080, '<td valign="top">Love the sepia. Slightly OOF? Could be deliberate for the effect.. in which case would possibly have done it some more?  Maybe just a bit too much of a snapshot, but a nice one!</td>', 'Love the sepia. Slightly OOF? Could be deliberate for the effect.. in which case would possibly have done it some more?  Maybe just a bit too much of a snapshot, but a nice one!', '2005-01-18 16:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117229, 135752, 18080, '<td valign="top">Nice effect. Very clear, would like to have lost a little more of the mud in top left corner.</td>', 'Nice effect. Very clear, would like to have lost a little more of the mud in top left corner.', '2005-01-18 16:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117233, 136467, 18080, '<td valign="top">Why B&amp;W? Wouldn''t the green grass have helped the notion of decay and overgrowth? Nice picture anyway.</td>', 'Why B&W? Wouldn''t the green grass have helped the notion of decay and overgrowth? Nice picture anyway.', '2005-01-18 16:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117258, 137002, 21621, '<td valign="top">Very creative, not easy to get this viewpoint of the real thing.  Good work.</td>', 'Very creative, not easy to get this viewpoint of the real thing.  Good work.', '2005-01-18 16:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117264, 137118, 21621, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like the mood, might benefit from cropping out the pole on the left.  God work.</td>', 'Nice shot, I like the mood, might benefit from cropping out the pole on the left.  God work.', '2005-01-18 16:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117268, 136699, 21621, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, interesting composition and color, kind of reminds me of LOTR.  Good work.</td>', 'Nice shot, interesting composition and color, kind of reminds me of LOTR.  Good work.', '2005-01-18 16:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117270, 137249, 30818, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast between the light in the forground and the clock tower in the back, but there is a little too much yellow in this shot (aside from the clock tower).</td>', 'I love the contrast between the light in the forground and the clock tower in the back, but there is a little too much yellow in this shot (aside from the clock tower).', '2005-01-18 16:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117281, 137083, 21621, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I really like the composition, might benefit from more definition in the clouds.  Nice work.</td>', 'Great shot, I really like the composition, might benefit from more definition in the clouds.  Nice work.', '2005-01-18 16:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117282, 137251, 30818, '<td valign="top">The lighting is kind of off.  I think this shot could''ve been GREAT at sunset when there is some a little natural light, but the lights are on!  The 2 pink signs are blown out...  my attention goes right there...  not good!</td>', 'The lighting is kind of off.  I think this shot could''ve been GREAT at sunset when there is some a little natural light, but the lights are on!  The 2 pink signs are blown out...  my attention goes right there...  not good!', '2005-01-18 16:55:17.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1117285, 136700, 21621, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like the composition, a bit overexposed.  Good work.</td>', 'Nice shot, I like the composition, a bit overexposed.  Good work.', '2005-01-18 16:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117396, 136699, 30818, '<td valign="top">there is a little too much blue in this shot, otherwise it''s awesome!  8</td>', 'there is a little too much blue in this shot, otherwise it''s awesome!  8', '2005-01-18 18:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117407, 136638, 4810, '<td valign="top">Stærsta F merki á Íslandi. Flott mynd.</td>', 'Stærsta F merki á Íslandi. Flott mynd.', '2005-01-18 18:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117424, 137169, 30818, '<td valign="top">awesome picture, but I expected the focus of the shot to be on architecture...  this is more of a natural shot. 7</td>', 'awesome picture, but I expected the focus of the shot to be on architecture...  this is more of a natural shot. 7', '2005-01-18 18:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117445, 135428, 4810, '<td valign="top">Háteigskirkja. One of the most beautiful churches in Iceland. Nice work.</td>', 'Háteigskirkja. One of the most beautiful churches in Iceland. Nice work.', '2005-01-18 18:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117450, 136464, 9763, '<td valign="top">Alright, are you a tourist or one of my LA DPC friends :)  Great shot!  Excellent color, though I think the building is silver.  The bright light on the lower left is a bit distracting, but I love the shot as a whole!  Definitely excellent capture of this amazing building.  Best of luck to you!</td>', 'Alright, are you a tourist or one of my LA DPC friends :)  Great shot!  Excellent color, though I think the building is silver.  The bright light on the lower left is a bit distracting, but I love the shot as a whole!  Definitely excellent capture of this amazing building.  Best of luck to you!', '2005-01-18 18:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117460, 137118, 4810, '<td valign="top">Flott mynd. Kemur vel út að hafa hana í svart hvítu. Staurinn til vinstri er bara til að bæta myndina.</td>', 'Flott mynd. Kemur vel út að hafa hana í svart hvítu. Staurinn til vinstri er bara til að bæta myndina.', '2005-01-18 18:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117469, 136460, 14763, '<td valign="top">A Little bit blurring</td>', 'A Little bit blurring', '2005-01-18 18:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117471, 137091, 14763, '<td valign="top">Clean Shot</td>', 'Clean Shot', '2005-01-18 18:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117496, 136917, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great observation - looks reminiscent of a clip from Gladiator or something epic like that. The only niggle is the crooked fence and the pole in the background.</td>', 'Great observation - looks reminiscent of a clip from Gladiator or something epic like that. The only niggle is the crooked fence and the pole in the background.', '2005-01-18 19:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117497, 137174, 8054, '<td valign="top">Although nicely composed, this lacks punch and that cetain something that makes me say wow. Also, it appears to be very centered assuming your main focal point are the two rusted structures. Having said that, focus is good and colors are nice and saturated. No annoying bright spots.</td>', 'Although nicely composed, this lacks punch and that cetain something that makes me say wow. Also, it appears to be very centered assuming your main focal point are the two rusted structures. Having said that, focus is good and colors are nice and saturated. No annoying bright spots.', '2005-01-18 19:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117499, 136968, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful form in your subject, very crisp image with deep, satisfying tones.</td>', 'Beautiful form in your subject, very crisp image with deep, satisfying tones.', '2005-01-18 19:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117500, 136623, 8054, '<td valign="top">This is a striking design study but the angle and distance make it have much less impact. If you were to concentrate on one aspect of the building and crop it just right, it would do very well.</td>', 'This is a striking design study but the angle and distance make it have much less impact. If you were to concentrate on one aspect of the building and crop it just right, it would do very well.', '2005-01-18 19:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117503, 136754, 8860, '<td valign="top">Now - I can''t believe I''ve never seen a pic of this before! What a hilarious concept. Only in America!(?)</td>', 'Now - I can''t believe I''ve never seen a pic of this before! What a hilarious concept. Only in America!(?)', '2005-01-18 19:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117515, 136434, 8054, '<td valign="top">Based on your title, I cannot see books nor can I tell it''s part of a library. What I do see is an interesting pattern of wooden beams and panels. Shadows appear to be sharp and strong and a bit more than I usually like. Color appears to be off but I do not know what it really looks like. Focus is iffy as I cannot see sharp details of the wood grain.</td>', 'Based on your title, I cannot see books nor can I tell it''s part of a library. What I do see is an interesting pattern of wooden beams and panels. Shadows appear to be sharp and strong and a bit more than I usually like. Color appears to be off but I do not know what it really looks like. Focus is iffy as I cannot see sharp details of the wood grain.', '2005-01-18 19:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117531, 137254, 8054, '<td valign="top">Perhaps if you had less city lights on the bottom and more details of the bridge might make this more appealing. The long exposure makes any light source seem to grow in size making it appear large and less detailed. Look at the fine lines of the bridge suspension and you''ll see what I mean. Great job of keeping noise at a minimum!</td>', 'Perhaps if you had less city lights on the bottom and more details of the bridge might make this more appealing. The long exposure makes any light source seem to grow in size making it appear large and less detailed. Look at the fine lines of the bridge suspension and you''ll see what I mean. Great job of keeping noise at a minimum!', '2005-01-18 19:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117538, 137184, 8054, '<td valign="top">I really like the angle you utilized in this shot. Well thought out and excecuted. Clouds are very detailed and add to the feel. Border has a heavy weight about it but seems appropriate for the most part. Two things really bother me, however: the light inside the building and the light splotch on the brick that seems to have been dodged a lot. The sliver of light bulb is distracting to overall darkness of the interior and screams for attention. The lighter colored brickwork is a different shade than the rest and just looks out of place. Excellent job otherwise.</td>', 'I really like the angle you utilized in this shot. Well thought out and excecuted. Clouds are very detailed and add to the feel. Border has a heavy weight about it but seems appropriate for the most part. Two things really bother me, however: the light inside the building and the light splotch on the brick that seems to have been dodged a lot. The sliver of light bulb is distracting to overall darkness of the interior and screams for attention. The lighter colored brickwork is a different shade than the rest and just looks out of place. Excellent job otherwise.', '2005-01-18 19:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117546, 137152, 14763, '<td valign="top">Would have been better if you got the whole building in the picture</td>', 'Would have been better if you got the whole building in the picture', '2005-01-18 19:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117561, 137049, 31916, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the composition, nice job.</td>', 'I like the colors and the composition, nice job.', '2005-01-18 19:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117568, 137131, 31916, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like the positioning at the bottom.</td>', 'Nice shot, I like the positioning at the bottom.', '2005-01-18 19:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117583, 137126, 31916, '<td valign="top">Love the mood this evokes and how the lines draw the eye through.  Good composition.</td>', 'Love the mood this evokes and how the lines draw the eye through.  Good composition.', '2005-01-18 19:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117598, 136762, 16148, '<td valign="top">Great colors in this entry.  Hope to see you in the top 10.</td>', 'Great colors in this entry.  Hope to see you in the top 10.', '2005-01-18 19:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1118026, 135276, 23680, '<td valign="top">I really like the angle and tone you did here.  10</td>', 'I really like the angle and tone you did here.  10', '2005-01-18 23:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1118046, 136782, 26756, '<td valign="top">I''m not a huge fan of the point your camera skyward type architecture pics but you did it nicely and pulled of a pleasing image.  Lots of patterns and lines, good color and nice diagonal viewpoint.</td>', 'I''m not a huge fan of the point your camera skyward type architecture pics but you did it nicely and pulled of a pleasing image.  Lots of patterns and lines, good color and nice diagonal viewpoint.', '2005-01-18 23:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1118290, 136598, 17507, '<td valign="top">Um... interesting twist on the theme! I actually giggled when I saw this because it''s so vastly different from the others in this challenge. I''m afraid it might be a bit *too* free an interpretation of the challenge...</td>', 'Um... interesting twist on the theme! I actually giggled when I saw this because it''s so vastly different from the others in this challenge. I''m afraid it might be a bit *too* free an interpretation of the challenge...', '2005-01-19 01:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1118450, 136159, 6172, '<td valign="top">This is cool.  I like the trees, too.</td>', 'This is cool.  I like the trees, too.', '2005-01-19 03:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1118477, 137083, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  Great composition and I like the colors.</td>', 'Very nicely done!  Great composition and I like the colors.', '2005-01-19 03:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1118480, 137210, 6172, '<td valign="top">this doesn''t look quite right to me so overexposed</td>', 'this doesn''t look quite right to me so overexposed', '2005-01-19 03:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1118539, 135752, 15832, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool prespective.. I think it would even score better if you would have rotatet it 180°.  That gives it more cool feeling (IMHO).  try it</td>', 'That''s a cool prespective.. I think it would even score better if you would have rotatet it 180°.  That gives it more cool feeling (IMHO).  try it', '2005-01-19 05:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1118547, 137012, 15832, '<td valign="top">Wow.. That´s a wicked photo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-24 03:38:30.</i></td>', 'Wow.. That´s a wicked photo', '2005-01-19 06:17:41.000000', '2005-01-24 03:38:30.000000', 1),
(1118553, 137123, 15832, '<td valign="top">Great work....</td>', 'Great work....', '2005-01-19 06:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1118572, 136912, 15919, '<td valign="top">Cool reflection, nice colors, sharp and clean.  Very good image.</td>', 'Cool reflection, nice colors, sharp and clean.  Very good image.', '2005-01-19 06:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1118574, 136443, 15919, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image though I´m not sure how well it presents the challenge subject.  Well architecture is surly also on microscale and this is a part of a building so you´ve got my credit.</td>', 'This is a very nice image though I´m not sure how well it presents the challenge subject.  Well architecture is surly also on microscale and this is a part of a building so you´ve got my credit.', '2005-01-19 07:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1118579, 137033, 15919, '<td valign="top">Like the deep blue color, sharp and clean.  The subject itself maybe not very interesting for my opinion but well performed.</td>', 'Like the deep blue color, sharp and clean.  The subject itself maybe not very interesting for my opinion but well performed.', '2005-01-19 07:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1118582, 136292, 15919, '<td valign="top">very noise and needs better editing.  The angel is pretty staight forward and it lacks creativity</td>', 'very noise and needs better editing.  The angel is pretty staight forward and it lacks creativity', '2005-01-19 07:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1118620, 136598, 8569, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot,  but dose not fit the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful shot,  but dose not fit the challenge.', '2005-01-19 07:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1118629, 136884, 8569, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but looks a little soft.</td>', 'Nice shot but looks a little soft.', '2005-01-19 07:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1118634, 137116, 18219, '<td valign="top">great watery like reflections</td>', 'great watery like reflections', '2005-01-19 07:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1118637, 136992, 18219, '<td valign="top">I love the idea on this one.<br/>It just doesn''t seem clear enough.<br/>Maybe if the lighting was different it would show up better?</td>', 'I love the idea on this one.It just doesn''t seem clear enough.Maybe if the lighting was different it would show up better?', '2005-01-19 07:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1118648, 136755, 18219, '<td valign="top">nice duotone and use of shadows.</td>', 'nice duotone and use of shadows.', '2005-01-19 07:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1118668, 136223, 8569, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.  I really like this shot!!</td>', 'Nice perspective.  I really like this shot!!', '2005-01-19 07:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119005, 136944, 18780, '<td valign="top">Great shot - 10</td>', 'Great shot - 10', '2005-01-19 11:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119007, 137249, 9763, '<td valign="top">Is this Philly?  That looks like William Penn.  This is a really cool photo, but sadly, it''s a bit grainy.  I love the composition and crop.  The lights going down the street really lead your eyes too!  Excellent capture, but again... grain.  If you could take this one again on a tripod with 100 ISO set and leave the shutter open much longer, I bet you could get a truly awesome photo from this very spot!  Good luck :)</td>', 'Is this Philly?  That looks like William Penn.  This is a really cool photo, but sadly, it''s a bit grainy.  I love the composition and crop.  The lights going down the street really lead your eyes too!  Excellent capture, but again... grain.  If you could take this one again on a tripod with 100 ISO set and leave the shutter open much longer, I bet you could get a truly awesome photo from this very spot!  Good luck :)', '2005-01-19 11:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119013, 137214, 26756, '<td valign="top">Clean, well exposed and well composed. Nice work.</td>', 'Clean, well exposed and well composed. Nice work.', '2005-01-19 11:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119189, 136762, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great colours and the steam looks excellent.9</td>', 'Great colours and the steam looks excellent.9', '2005-01-19 13:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119230, 137131, 17033, '<td valign="top">I recognise this from a past blue-ribbon winner!  Very simple yet beautiful  composition aided by the  dreamy background. well done.</td>', 'I recognise this from a past blue-ribbon winner!  Very simple yet beautiful  composition aided by the  dreamy background. well done.', '2005-01-19 13:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119243, 136378, 17033, '<td valign="top">Nice colours but perhaps a little mundane. Have you thought about getting much closer or further away?</td>', 'Nice colours but perhaps a little mundane. Have you thought about getting much closer or further away?', '2005-01-19 13:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119256, 136638, 17033, '<td valign="top">Is this on the road between the airport and the centre of Dublin? If so, are you Xion?!! Very nice lines but  I think the shamrock distracts from  that...makes it look too mall-y.</td>', 'Is this on the road between the airport and the centre of Dublin? If so, are you Xion?!! Very nice lines but  I think the shamrock distracts from  that...makes it look too mall-y.', '2005-01-19 13:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119259, 136316, 17033, '<td valign="top">Monolithic splendour. very imposing</td>', 'Monolithic splendour. very imposing', '2005-01-19 13:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119266, 137166, 21899, '<td valign="top">Vibrant colors, nice angle to get the detail on the chimney.  Great photo!</td>', 'Vibrant colors, nice angle to get the detail on the chimney.  Great photo!', '2005-01-19 13:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119269, 136699, 17033, '<td valign="top">Another view of another Icelandic building but I like this very much. Probably one of the most terrifying buildings I have ever seen. I think the blue tint is a little too dark in the foreground but otherwise this is a great shot.</td>', 'Another view of another Icelandic building but I like this very much. Probably one of the most terrifying buildings I have ever seen. I think the blue tint is a little too dark in the foreground but otherwise this is a great shot.', '2005-01-19 13:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119276, 136656, 17033, '<td valign="top">Very good post-processing to make this other-wordly and yet very familiar with the snow. Is this where  the  teletubbies have moved to?</td>', 'Very good post-processing to make this other-wordly and yet very familiar with the snow. Is this where  the  teletubbies have moved to?', '2005-01-19 13:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119374, 135276, 17033, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic and well composed</td>', 'Very dramatic and well composed', '2005-01-19 14:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119375, 136663, 17033, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and nice white/red contrast</td>', 'Excellent composition and nice white/red contrast', '2005-01-19 14:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119378, 136782, 17033, '<td valign="top">Absorbingly detailed. Good angle to keep interest</td>', 'Absorbingly detailed. Good angle to keep interest', '2005-01-19 14:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119385, 136900, 17033, '<td valign="top">Pleasingly regimented composition. Nice wedding cake-like detail.</td>', 'Pleasingly regimented composition. Nice wedding cake-like detail.', '2005-01-19 14:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119391, 137083, 17033, '<td valign="top">?BobsterLobster. Very nice line and I like the contrast with the sky but  maybe it would have been nice to see through at least one span.</td>', '?BobsterLobster. Very nice line and I like the contrast with the sky but  maybe it would have been nice to see through at least one span.', '2005-01-19 14:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
