(1119569, 135521, 24642, '<td valign="top">A timeless photograph with varying patterns and textures.<br/> <br/>The subject is very complex and IMO the photograph doesn''t do enough to resolve the complexity.  On the other hand if the main purpose of the photograph is be chaotic displaying various patterns and textures I think the bottom should be cropped tighter.<br/> <br/>Anyway this seems like a photograph done by a skillful photographer, with a trained aye.</td>', 'A timeless photograph with varying patterns and textures. The subject is very complex and IMO the photograph doesn''t do enough to resolve the complexity.  On the other hand if the main purpose of the photograph is be chaotic displaying various patterns and textures I think the bottom should be cropped tighter. Anyway this seems like a photograph done by a skillful photographer, with a trained aye.', '2005-01-19 16:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119581, 137010, 24642, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and viewpoint.  I really like the tension and the flow.  Beautiful colours in the windows.</td>', 'Nice composition and viewpoint.  I really like the tension and the flow.  Beautiful colours in the windows.', '2005-01-19 16:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119591, 136936, 24642, '<td valign="top">I think this is too symmetrical for a silhouette photo that is all most two dimensional.</td>', 'I think this is too symmetrical for a silhouette photo that is all most two dimensional.', '2005-01-19 16:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119598, 137187, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good work with texture and shade.  The allmost centered viewpoint bothers me though.</td>', 'Good work with texture and shade.  The allmost centered viewpoint bothers me though.', '2005-01-19 16:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119605, 135877, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the witty title and it makes sense with the tilted viewpoint.  The lighting and the reflections really help the image to escape from the flat 2 dimentional trap.<br/>Good work.</td>', 'I like the witty title and it makes sense with the tilted viewpoint.  The lighting and the reflections really help the image to escape from the flat 2 dimentional trap.Good work.', '2005-01-19 16:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119615, 136371, 24642, '<td valign="top">Oooh industrial,  I love the lighting here and the contrast between the logo and the metal background.</td>', 'Oooh industrial,  I love the lighting here and the contrast between the logo and the metal background.', '2005-01-19 16:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119622, 136957, 24642, '<td valign="top">Powerful and well balanced composition.  Lighting is very good and balances well with the building.</td>', 'Powerful and well balanced composition.  Lighting is very good and balances well with the building.', '2005-01-19 16:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119635, 136774, 24642, '<td valign="top">I find the crop to tight at the top.  A shot made earlyer would probably add more depth.</td>', 'I find the crop to tight at the top.  A shot made earlyer would probably add more depth.', '2005-01-19 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
