(1119645, 136950, 24642, '<td valign="top">This is a good subject and a fine viewpoint.  I am missing a straight vertical line in the composition and more space on the left to let the arch flow to the bottom.</td>', 'This is a good subject and a fine viewpoint.  I am missing a straight vertical line in the composition and more space on the left to let the arch flow to the bottom.', '2005-01-19 16:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119652, 136919, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good work with the contrasting patterns.  The dark shadow in the bottom right corner bothers me, I think that a square crop from the top would have made a more striking image.</td>', 'Good work with the contrasting patterns.  The dark shadow in the bottom right corner bothers me, I think that a square crop from the top would have made a more striking image.', '2005-01-19 16:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
