(1119933, 135521, 26756, '<td valign="top">Rivendel?  The stone work, the twisted tree limbs, the curve of the stairs...brilliant!!<br/>Don''t know what the towering skyscraper crowd will give you but you get a 10 from me.</td>', 'Rivendel?  The stone work, the twisted tree limbs, the curve of the stairs...brilliant!!Don''t know what the towering skyscraper crowd will give you but you get a 10 from me.', '2005-01-19 18:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119998, 136223, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  The sci fi feel and the tilted viewpoint.  It seems to me that the image is slightly overexposed, I don''t know if it was on purpose or not but I think it would benefit from more contrasts and depth within the garage.  Anyways a creative and cool shot. -9</td>', 'I like this one.  The sci fi feel and the tilted viewpoint.  It seems to me that the image is slightly overexposed, I don''t know if it was on purpose or not but I think it would benefit from more contrasts and depth within the garage.  Anyways a creative and cool shot. -9', '2005-01-19 19:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120005, 135276, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very good work.  I think the tilted viewpoint adds a new dimension to the symmetry.  Texture, lines, tension, drama.  It''s all in this image.</td>', 'Very good work.  I think the tilted viewpoint adds a new dimension to the symmetry.  Texture, lines, tension, drama.  It''s all in this image.', '2005-01-19 19:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120022, 137033, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very nice work with so many elements.  First of all I like the abstraction of the image.  The composition is good with the black line on the left as a anchor in the image and there is enough tension to make it interesting.  The colours of the bricks and the sky harmonizes well.  Then as a bonus to it all there is the reflection, interesting texture and good tonal range.  -10</td>', 'Very nice work with so many elements.  First of all I like the abstraction of the image.  The composition is good with the black line on the left as a anchor in the image and there is enough tension to make it interesting.  The colours of the bricks and the sky harmonizes well.  Then as a bonus to it all there is the reflection, interesting texture and good tonal range.  -10', '2005-01-19 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120040, 137040, 26756, '<td valign="top">The heavy amount of burning fits this photo pretty well.  I love old, I love stone, so you roped me in. 9</td>', 'The heavy amount of burning fits this photo pretty well.  I love old, I love stone, so you roped me in. 9', '2005-01-19 19:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120175, 137139, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s a very interesting structure, but I think I''d have like your photo better without the van.  It''s such a comical looking vehicle (reminds me of Thomas the Tank Engine) that I think it''s a distraction rather than a positive contributor to the impact of your shot.  Maybe a motor scooter?  6.</td>', 'It''s a very interesting structure, but I think I''d have like your photo better without the van.  It''s such a comical looking vehicle (reminds me of Thomas the Tank Engine) that I think it''s a distraction rather than a positive contributor to the impact of your shot.  Maybe a motor scooter?  6.', '2005-01-19 20:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120181, 137083, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a striking photograph of an impressive structure.  The composition/perspective is sympathetic &amp; the framing/cropping emphasises the viaduct''s character.  8.</td>', 'This is a striking photograph of an impressive structure.  The composition/perspective is sympathetic & the framing/cropping emphasises the viaduct''s character.  8.', '2005-01-19 20:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120191, 135736, 30364, '<td valign="top">Here you are apparently deliberately striving for a particular effect, the point of which I''m afraid eludes me.  But that may well be my problem, rather than yours!  5</td>', 'Here you are apparently deliberately striving for a particular effect, the point of which I''m afraid eludes me.  But that may well be my problem, rather than yours!  5', '2005-01-19 20:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120202, 135752, 30364, '<td valign="top">First I thought, so what ... just show me the columns.  But then I realised how very clever this is, because it seemed like looking back in time to a vanished, classical age.  Finally I decided I probably shouldn''t have had that third whiskey.  Whatever, it''s a memorable image.  7.</td>', 'First I thought, so what ... just show me the columns.  But then I realised how very clever this is, because it seemed like looking back in time to a vanished, classical age.  Finally I decided I probably shouldn''t have had that third whiskey.  Whatever, it''s a memorable image.  7.', '2005-01-19 20:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120206, 137214, 30364, '<td valign="top">If this is a building, the lifts must provide an alarming ride.  But I guess its a sculpture?  Looks spectacular and the photo is very good.  6.</td>', 'If this is a building, the lifts must provide an alarming ride.  But I guess its a sculpture?  Looks spectacular and the photo is very good.  6.', '2005-01-19 20:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120210, 136434, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is the central gizmo in a ceiling, right?  Not a wooden flag?  Whatever it is, I''m afraid I don''t find it a very interesting subject.  It tells me something about the construction of the structure, I guess, but nothing much about it''s architecture.  Sorry.  4.</td>', 'This is the central gizmo in a ceiling, right?  Not a wooden flag?  Whatever it is, I''m afraid I don''t find it a very interesting subject.  It tells me something about the construction of the structure, I guess, but nothing much about it''s architecture.  Sorry.  4.', '2005-01-19 20:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120229, 136994, 30364, '<td valign="top">Good grief!  Where is this?  Hope you''re not one of the poor buggers who have to live in it?  That aside, it''s a very impressive image.  OK composition and point of view.  I see one non-conformist has left his window open.  Plans on jumping, I expect.  6.</td>', 'Good grief!  Where is this?  Hope you''re not one of the poor buggers who have to live in it?  That aside, it''s a very impressive image.  OK composition and point of view.  I see one non-conformist has left his window open.  Plans on jumping, I expect.  6.', '2005-01-19 20:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120234, 136622, 30364, '<td valign="top">Is it really?  Vincent probably wouldn''t have liked it much.  Looks like a water reservoir, with a father watching his son trying to fill it up.  Your point of view is nice, though, and at least gives this ghastly structure some visual interest.  5.</td>', 'Is it really?  Vincent probably wouldn''t have liked it much.  Looks like a water reservoir, with a father watching his son trying to fill it up.  Your point of view is nice, though, and at least gives this ghastly structure some visual interest.  5.', '2005-01-19 20:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120247, 136968, 30364, '<td valign="top">This looks very striking.  The white columns &amp; the white spire have a apposite glowing look, especially against the ominous sky.  7.</td>', 'This looks very striking.  The white columns & the white spire have a apposite glowing look, especially against the ominous sky.  7.', '2005-01-19 21:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120347, 136471, 18194, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately I think this photo suffers from being force to a size of 640 pixels. There is so much detail that it gets a bit lost at this size, I would think it looks much better at full size.</td>', 'Unfortunately I think this photo suffers from being force to a size of 640 pixels. There is so much detail that it gets a bit lost at this size, I would think it looks much better at full size.', '2005-01-19 21:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120368, 137186, 18194, '<td valign="top">This is a nice enough photo but is seems just a bit flat to me.  The tonal range of the church is fairly narrow.</td>', 'This is a nice enough photo but is seems just a bit flat to me.  The tonal range of the church is fairly narrow.', '2005-01-19 21:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120373, 136346, 18194, '<td valign="top">I normally dont like photos that are taken at odd angle but it seems to work well here.</td>', 'I normally dont like photos that are taken at odd angle but it seems to work well here.', '2005-01-19 21:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120382, 136877, 18194, '<td valign="top">It seems like there is a patch work of in and out of focus areas, rather disturbing for me at least.</td>', 'It seems like there is a patch work of in and out of focus areas, rather disturbing for me at least.', '2005-01-19 21:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120384, 136595, 18194, '<td valign="top">I love your title, you may have just coined a new word.</td>', 'I love your title, you may have just coined a new word.', '2005-01-19 21:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120447, 137215, 11895, '<td valign="top">I like this shot but somehow the colors don''t look very natural</td>', 'I like this shot but somehow the colors don''t look very natural', '2005-01-19 22:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120468, 136836, 11895, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, it has very pleasing depth of field, but it seems a stretch to fit the topic in an Acrhitecture challenge,</td>', 'I really like this shot, it has very pleasing depth of field, but it seems a stretch to fit the topic in an Acrhitecture challenge,', '2005-01-19 22:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120585, 135877, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a very stylish &amp; rather abstract photograph.  The bronze and the reflected blue sky makes a nice high-tech looking combination.  It doesn''t tell me much about the architecture, but it is certainly a high impact image.  6.</td>', 'This is a very stylish & rather abstract photograph.  The bronze and the reflected blue sky makes a nice high-tech looking combination.  It doesn''t tell me much about the architecture, but it is certainly a high impact image.  6.', '2005-01-19 23:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120589, 137224, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s an arresting shot, but doesn''t say much to me about the architecture.  Of course, in this case there''s perhaps not much to say.  5.</td>', 'It''s an arresting shot, but doesn''t say much to me about the architecture.  Of course, in this case there''s perhaps not much to say.  5.', '2005-01-19 23:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120598, 136471, 30364, '<td valign="top">This looks very intriguing, but it might be more the construction than the design that gets your attention.  I don''t think it says much about the architecture.  Sorry.  4.</td>', 'This looks very intriguing, but it might be more the construction than the design that gets your attention.  I don''t think it says much about the architecture.  Sorry.  4.', '2005-01-19 23:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120610, 137238, 30364, '<td valign="top">Building looks like Colonel Sanders hat.  However, it''s an interesting shot and a good point of view to display this architectural monstrosity.  6.</td>', 'Building looks like Colonel Sanders hat.  However, it''s an interesting shot and a good point of view to display this architectural monstrosity.  6.', '2005-01-19 23:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120612, 135850, 30364, '<td valign="top">This a very striking composition, featuring a bit of an apparently interesting structure.  It''s a good photograph, yet it doesn''t say much to me about architecture, just photographic composition.  Maybe it doesn''t have to; I still like it.  6.</td>', 'This a very striking composition, featuring a bit of an apparently interesting structure.  It''s a good photograph, yet it doesn''t say much to me about architecture, just photographic composition.  Maybe it doesn''t have to; I still like it.  6.', '2005-01-20 00:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120616, 136900, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a very "architectural" shot.  It could almost be a fine elevation drawing.  And it''s a clever composition that rewards a few minutes study.  7.</td>', 'This is a very "architectural" shot.  It could almost be a fine elevation drawing.  And it''s a clever composition that rewards a few minutes study.  7.', '2005-01-20 00:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120622, 136292, 30364, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the cropping much because it is so severe as to deny me any real idea of the architectural style or merits of the building.  And the close details you''ve chosen to showcase here are, to me, not sufficiently distinctive to merit the the attention you''ve given them.  Sorry.  4.</td>', 'I don''t like the cropping much because it is so severe as to deny me any real idea of the architectural style or merits of the building.  And the close details you''ve chosen to showcase here are, to me, not sufficiently distinctive to merit the the attention you''ve given them.  Sorry.  4.', '2005-01-20 00:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120624, 137020, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful building &amp; a nice photo of it.  I think you probably had to find a viewpoint that would include the whole structure, to show its distinctive shape, even though some of the elaborate structural detail is lost at this distance. 6.</td>', 'Beautiful building & a nice photo of it.  I think you probably had to find a viewpoint that would include the whole structure, to show its distinctive shape, even though some of the elaborate structural detail is lost at this distance. 6.', '2005-01-20 00:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120665, 135181, 30364, '<td valign="top">I see your intention, but it still seems more a picture of trees than architecture. Sorry.  4.</td>', 'I see your intention, but it still seems more a picture of trees than architecture. Sorry.  4.', '2005-01-20 01:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120679, 136466, 27468, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. I love to flowing lines of the building, the rigid frame, and the contrasting colors.</td>', 'Wonderful. I love to flowing lines of the building, the rigid frame, and the contrasting colors.', '2005-01-20 01:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120685, 136467, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well I see what you mean, but this is a garden ornament.  A surprising one, I will admit.  But it doesn''t say much to me about architecture &amp; your view of it.  Sorry.  4.</td>', 'Well I see what you mean, but this is a garden ornament.  A surprising one, I will admit.  But it doesn''t say much to me about architecture & your view of it.  Sorry.  4.', '2005-01-20 01:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120686, 136902, 30364, '<td valign="top">A Queenslander?  It''s a very good architectural detail shot.  I think it would have made even more impact with the gate open, because I think the gate is at odds with the building and gateway.  6.</td>', 'A Queenslander?  It''s a very good architectural detail shot.  I think it would have made even more impact with the gate open, because I think the gate is at odds with the building and gateway.  6.', '2005-01-20 01:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120687, 136512, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I don''t much like the lurid colours &amp; contrast.  It is not, for me, a photo that says anything about architecture.  Sorry.  3.</td>', 'I''m afraid I don''t much like the lurid colours & contrast.  It is not, for me, a photo that says anything about architecture.  Sorry.  3.', '2005-01-20 01:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120690, 137237, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a startling image, for the reason expressed in your title.  You chose a very nice point of view; any visible foreground or any excessive visible sky would have detracted from your message here.  7.</td>', 'This is a startling image, for the reason expressed in your title.  You chose a very nice point of view; any visible foreground or any excessive visible sky would have detracted from your message here.  7.', '2005-01-20 01:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120692, 136780, 30364, '<td valign="top">Especially effective because to me the architectural styles of the two buildings are related.  The newer stands on the shoulders of the older, both literally and figuratively.  The uncorrected perspective looks right as well here (at least I think it''s not been corrected).  7.</td>', 'Especially effective because to me the architectural styles of the two buildings are related.  The newer stands on the shoulders of the older, both literally and figuratively.  The uncorrected perspective looks right as well here (at least I think it''s not been corrected).  7.', '2005-01-20 01:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120695, 136159, 30364, '<td valign="top">Great photo but awful title (that''s an "in" joke, but you''ll figure it out).  The building is spectacular and your photo is technically very good, but I think the best thing you did was to stand in EXACTLY the right place for maximum effect.  You understood this building as a subject.  Well done.  8.</td>', 'Great photo but awful title (that''s an "in" joke, but you''ll figure it out).  The building is spectacular and your photo is technically very good, but I think the best thing you did was to stand in EXACTLY the right place for maximum effect.  You understood this building as a subject.  Well done.  8.', '2005-01-20 01:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120696, 136985, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a well conceived &amp; executed photo of a very unusual architectural subject.  Your capture of the sky in the roof cladding was, I imagine, just what the architect was intending.  7.</td>', 'This is a well conceived & executed photo of a very unusual architectural subject.  Your capture of the sky in the roof cladding was, I imagine, just what the architect was intending.  7.', '2005-01-20 01:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120697, 136701, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s a visually arresting image, but I think it''s more about construction than architecture.  Sorry.  4.</td>', 'It''s a visually arresting image, but I think it''s more about construction than architecture.  Sorry.  4.', '2005-01-20 01:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120698, 136544, 21202, '<td valign="top">This could use more contrast.  A 4.</td>', 'This could use more contrast.  A 4.', '2005-01-20 02:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120699, 136917, 21202, '<td valign="top">I would prefer a shorter exposure.  A lot of detail is lost in the glare.  A 5.</td>', 'I would prefer a shorter exposure.  A lot of detail is lost in the glare.  A 5.', '2005-01-20 02:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120700, 136920, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice photo of a dreadful architectural mistake.  6.</td>', 'Nice photo of a dreadful architectural mistake.  6.', '2005-01-20 02:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120702, 136877, 21202, '<td valign="top">A smaller aperture would have allowed more of the picture to be in focus.  A 5.</td>', 'A smaller aperture would have allowed more of the picture to be in focus.  A 5.', '2005-01-20 02:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120705, 137135, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a terrific photo of a very impressive building.  Your composition and point of view are highly sympathetic to the architectural style and "personality" of the subject; you seem to have achieved the maximum visual impact of which this building is capable.   This photo would not look out of place on the cover of a fine architecture magazine or book.  9.</td>', 'This is a terrific photo of a very impressive building.  Your composition and point of view are highly sympathetic to the architectural style and "personality" of the subject; you seem to have achieved the maximum visual impact of which this building is capable.   This photo would not look out of place on the cover of a fine architecture magazine or book.  9.', '2005-01-20 02:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120707, 134932, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective &amp; composition to showcase this worthy subject.  It seems just a little over-processed to me, but maybe that''s needed here for the dramatic effect you have achieved.  7.</td>', 'Nice perspective & composition to showcase this worthy subject.  It seems just a little over-processed to me, but maybe that''s needed here for the dramatic effect you have achieved.  7.', '2005-01-20 02:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120709, 136711, 21202, '<td valign="top">Beautiful brick work.  I wonder about keystone only on face.  Nice picture, good exposure, point of view, focus, color balance.  An 8, as the lighting is a little on the dim side.</td>', 'Beautiful brick work.  I wonder about keystone only on face.  Nice picture, good exposure, point of view, focus, color balance.  An 8, as the lighting is a little on the dim side.', '2005-01-20 02:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120712, 136889, 30364, '<td valign="top">Dramatic treatment of high-impact subjects.   You chose a very good point of view.  7.</td>', 'Dramatic treatment of high-impact subjects.   You chose a very good point of view.  7.', '2005-01-20 02:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120714, 137183, 21202, '<td valign="top">Really nice reflections.  A lot of detail is lost in the shadows.  If you have a camera that has a raw mode, you might want to use raw to obtain a greater dynamic range.  The problem is similar to taking a picture indoors with a window facing a brighter outdoor view.  If you do not split your image to hsl before sharpening, and then sharpen on the lightness split only before recombining to rgb, you might try that as the image is the slightest bit blurry. A 5, because of the shadowed areas.</td>', 'Really nice reflections.  A lot of detail is lost in the shadows.  If you have a camera that has a raw mode, you might want to use raw to obtain a greater dynamic range.  The problem is similar to taking a picture indoors with a window facing a brighter outdoor view.  If you do not split your image to hsl before sharpening, and then sharpen on the lightness split only before recombining to rgb, you might try that as the image is the slightest bit blurry. A 5, because of the shadowed areas.', '2005-01-20 02:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120715, 136836, 30364, '<td valign="top">The waterfall is the subject here.  I''m afraid the old girder bridge is not prominent enough to say much about architecture.  But you get a bonus point for not calling it "Water Under the Bridge".  4.</td>', 'The waterfall is the subject here.  I''m afraid the old girder bridge is not prominent enough to say much about architecture.  But you get a bonus point for not calling it "Water Under the Bridge".  4.', '2005-01-20 02:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120716, 137009, 21202, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field.  Some fill flash would help as the subject is dark and the background well lit.  A 5.</td>', 'Great depth of field.  Some fill flash would help as the subject is dark and the background well lit.  A 5.', '2005-01-20 02:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120717, 137098, 30364, '<td valign="top">Good subject and point of view, really nice composition, but the shadow of the tree destroys your otherwise high-impact image.  What a pity.  5.</td>', 'Good subject and point of view, really nice composition, but the shadow of the tree destroys your otherwise high-impact image.  What a pity.  5.', '2005-01-20 02:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120718, 136638, 21202, '<td valign="top">Good sky.  A little fill flash would not have hurt, as the subject is blocking the light. A 5.</td>', 'Good sky.  A little fill flash would not have hurt, as the subject is blocking the light. A 5.', '2005-01-20 02:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120719, 136058, 30364, '<td valign="top">I think you have shown just barely enough of this house''s location to hint at the architect''s point about this building''s relationship to it''s environment.  A near miss for me.  Sorry.  5.</td>', 'I think you have shown just barely enough of this house''s location to hint at the architect''s point about this building''s relationship to it''s environment.  A near miss for me.  Sorry.  5.', '2005-01-20 02:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120721, 136475, 21202, '<td valign="top">The glare from the inside is a little overwhelming.  That whole area would be improved by selective darkening.  The outside though is beautifully rendered.  A 6.</td>', 'The glare from the inside is a little overwhelming.  That whole area would be improved by selective darkening.  The outside though is beautifully rendered.  A 6.', '2005-01-20 02:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120722, 136976, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why, but this just doesn''t come off for me.  Looks a bit cartoon-like, I guess.  I''m probably being harsh, because it''s a good photograph of a well composed scene.  It just lacks appeal somehow.  5.</td>', 'I''m not sure why, but this just doesn''t come off for me.  Looks a bit cartoon-like, I guess.  I''m probably being harsh, because it''s a good photograph of a well composed scene.  It just lacks appeal somehow.  5.', '2005-01-20 02:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120724, 135877, 21202, '<td valign="top">Beautifull colors, nice reflections, interesting rotation and cropping.  A 9.</td>', 'Beautifull colors, nice reflections, interesting rotation and cropping.  A 9.', '2005-01-20 02:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120728, 135428, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very clever shot.  I suspect you have made this building appear more interesting than it is, by selecting this view point.  I hate saying this, but I would have liked it better in colour I think.  (I hate saying it because it always seems a presumptuous comment, like saying to Da Vinci, "You know, old Mona might have looked better with a cigar").  Also a nice title.  7.</td>', 'A very clever shot.  I suspect you have made this building appear more interesting than it is, by selecting this view point.  I hate saying this, but I would have liked it better in colour I think.  (I hate saying it because it always seems a presumptuous comment, like saying to Da Vinci, "You know, old Mona might have looked better with a cigar").  Also a nice title.  7.', '2005-01-20 02:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120729, 136953, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s a good idea, but I think this one is a bit too crowded to have the impact you''d hoped for.  5.</td>', 'It''s a good idea, but I think this one is a bit too crowded to have the impact you''d hoped for.  5.', '2005-01-20 02:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120730, 136379, 30364, '<td valign="top">Killer title.  Nice image of an interesting subject.  The photograph looks a little bit soft, however, and I think slightly suffers for it.  6.</td>', 'Killer title.  Nice image of an interesting subject.  The photograph looks a little bit soft, however, and I think slightly suffers for it.  6.', '2005-01-20 02:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120731, 135949, 30364, '<td valign="top">I suppose they''d have noticed if you''d cut the tree down first?  It''s still a visually startling image.  7.</td>', 'I suppose they''d have noticed if you''d cut the tree down first?  It''s still a visually startling image.  7.', '2005-01-20 02:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120735, 137114, 30364, '<td valign="top">Not quite enough happening here to hold my attention (which could be my problem, not yours).  Although it did make me think of the Hindenburg, which was also highly pickle-like.  6.</td>', 'Not quite enough happening here to hold my attention (which could be my problem, not yours).  Although it did make me think of the Hindenburg, which was also highly pickle-like.  6.', '2005-01-20 02:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120741, 137137, 30364, '<td valign="top">The composition is really good, and would have thrilled the architect, who I''m certain would feel that you perfectly understood the building.  Your photograph rewards a few minutes study, or a second look at least, which is always a good sign.  8.</td>', 'The composition is really good, and would have thrilled the architect, who I''m certain would feel that you perfectly understood the building.  Your photograph rewards a few minutes study, or a second look at least, which is always a good sign.  8.', '2005-01-20 02:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120744, 137212, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting.  That''s probably really a tribute to the architect, but you understood what was there and how to capture it.  7.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting.  That''s probably really a tribute to the architect, but you understood what was there and how to capture it.  7.', '2005-01-20 02:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120747, 137158, 30364, '<td valign="top">What would you study here; celestial mechanics?  It is impressive architecture, that''s for sure, and your photograph is a good one.  But the tables &amp; chairs do seem to trivialise this massive hall a bit.  6.</td>', 'What would you study here; celestial mechanics?  It is impressive architecture, that''s for sure, and your photograph is a good one.  But the tables & chairs do seem to trivialise this massive hall a bit.  6.', '2005-01-20 02:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120760, 136394, 30364, '<td valign="top">Looks familiar but with no star.  The photo appears a bit overblown in the highlights, but I think you had to make the most of the spectacular halo of light, which gives this image its impact.  6.</td>', 'Looks familiar but with no star.  The photo appears a bit overblown in the highlights, but I think you had to make the most of the spectacular halo of light, which gives this image its impact.  6.', '2005-01-20 03:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120768, 137209, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting composition, which shows off the architectural detail very well.  You probably had no choice but to crop at this point anyway, but it''s effective.  I''d have tried a tiny bit more contrast, to better define the depth of the scene (it seems a little two-dimensional), but maybe you did try that &amp; preferred it this way?  6.</td>', 'This is an interesting composition, which shows off the architectural detail very well.  You probably had no choice but to crop at this point anyway, but it''s effective.  I''d have tried a tiny bit more contrast, to better define the depth of the scene (it seems a little two-dimensional), but maybe you did try that & preferred it this way?  6.', '2005-01-20 03:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120774, 136544, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is an attractive image.  I''m glad you didn''t kill it with excessive post-camera processing.  This small, quiet &amp; calm house may not be the most dramatic architectural achievement, but it fits its environment, &amp; your photo and treatment fits the house.  7.</td>', 'This is an attractive image.  I''m glad you didn''t kill it with excessive post-camera processing.  This small, quiet & calm house may not be the most dramatic architectural achievement, but it fits its environment, & your photo and treatment fits the house.  7.', '2005-01-20 03:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120775, 137105, 32308, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful picture.  Wonderfully composed, excellent color balance, visually pleasing.  The trees really make a huge contribution, and take away what would otherwise be a very angular, edgy picture.</td>', 'This is a beautiful picture.  Wonderfully composed, excellent color balance, visually pleasing.  The trees really make a huge contribution, and take away what would otherwise be a very angular, edgy picture.', '2005-01-20 03:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120785, 137131, 32308, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture.  Wonderful lighting, interesting composure.  I wish that I could be there again, I haven''t been in Reykjavik in many years.  The possibility for beautiful pictures like this abound, it''s nice that you have the eye to take advantage of them.</td>', 'Excellent picture.  Wonderful lighting, interesting composure.  I wish that I could be there again, I haven''t been in Reykjavik in many years.  The possibility for beautiful pictures like this abound, it''s nice that you have the eye to take advantage of them.', '2005-01-20 03:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120790, 137143, 32308, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed.  Conveys not only the beauty of the scene, but the feeling of the weather as well.</td>', 'Very nicely composed.  Conveys not only the beauty of the scene, but the feeling of the weather as well.', '2005-01-20 03:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120825, 136609, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well I suppose it is architecture, but I''m afraid if it is, it is not a very interesting structure, and nor is it a very interesting photograph of it.  The straight-on perspective does nothing to create a bit of interest.  Sorry.  3.</td>', 'Well I suppose it is architecture, but I''m afraid if it is, it is not a very interesting structure, and nor is it a very interesting photograph of it.  The straight-on perspective does nothing to create a bit of interest.  Sorry.  3.', '2005-01-20 04:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120827, 136472, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very interesting subject, but I think your treatment of it is more revealing of its construction than its architecture.  But a nice enough photo.  5</td>', 'A very interesting subject, but I think your treatment of it is more revealing of its construction than its architecture.  But a nice enough photo.  5', '2005-01-20 04:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120831, 136912, 30364, '<td valign="top">Reflected architectural scenes are hard to resist, for photographers and their veiwers.  I guess I''m saying that it''s not awfully original.  This is a good one, however, with a very good title as well.  6.</td>', 'Reflected architectural scenes are hard to resist, for photographers and their veiwers.  I guess I''m saying that it''s not awfully original.  This is a good one, however, with a very good title as well.  6.', '2005-01-20 04:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120837, 137223, 30364, '<td valign="top">Iceland''s marine fuel oil reservoir complex?  This is a visually striking photograph.  I hope, for the sake of the architect, that this particular view of the building does not show it to its best advantage.  If this IS its good side, then all I can say is the lighting is quite nice.  6.</td>', 'Iceland''s marine fuel oil reservoir complex?  This is a visually striking photograph.  I hope, for the sake of the architect, that this particular view of the building does not show it to its best advantage.  If this IS its good side, then all I can say is the lighting is quite nice.  6.', '2005-01-20 04:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120839, 137222, 30364, '<td valign="top">It looks like it may be a funeral home, in which case the title is cheeky.  Not a very appealing view of a spectacularly bland building.  Sorry. 4.</td>', 'It looks like it may be a funeral home, in which case the title is cheeky.  Not a very appealing view of a spectacularly bland building.  Sorry. 4.', '2005-01-20 04:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120843, 136944, 30364, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what it could be.  Does that matter?  Maybe not; it certainly gets your attention, and says something.  Something about the architect, if nothing else.  And it''s a good photo of this thing.  6.</td>', 'I don''t know what it could be.  Does that matter?  Maybe not; it certainly gets your attention, and says something.  Something about the architect, if nothing else.  And it''s a good photo of this thing.  6.', '2005-01-20 04:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120844, 137239, 30364, '<td valign="top">Sorry I don''t get it.  It''s a mediocre photo of an irrelevant subject with a bizarre title.  On the other hand, your spelling''s spot on.  Punctuation, too.  That''s a couple of points, right there.  2.</td>', 'Sorry I don''t get it.  It''s a mediocre photo of an irrelevant subject with a bizarre title.  On the other hand, your spelling''s spot on.  Punctuation, too.  That''s a couple of points, right there.  2.', '2005-01-20 05:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120846, 137077, 30364, '<td valign="top">It looks very nice; interesting shapes, angles &amp; colours.  But it doesn''t say much to me of an architectural nature.  Sorry.  4.</td>', 'It looks very nice; interesting shapes, angles & colours.  But it doesn''t say much to me of an architectural nature.  Sorry.  4.', '2005-01-20 05:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120865, 136917, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a very appealing image of an architectural detail.  This facade is not really a spectacular design, but it is beautifully displayed in the early morning sunlight, so I think this is a very legitimate architectural study.  It seems a bit over processed, but maybe that''s just the effect of the low-angle light source &amp; the sunlight flooding all the other colour out of the scene.  6.</td>', 'This is a very appealing image of an architectural detail.  This facade is not really a spectacular design, but it is beautifully displayed in the early morning sunlight, so I think this is a very legitimate architectural study.  It seems a bit over processed, but maybe that''s just the effect of the low-angle light source & the sunlight flooding all the other colour out of the scene.  6.', '2005-01-20 05:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120866, 135746, 30364, '<td valign="top">The only thing to improve this scene would be the corpse of the architect hanging from the battlements.  Just kidding.  It''s a grotesque building but a good photograph.  6</td>', 'The only thing to improve this scene would be the corpse of the architect hanging from the battlements.  Just kidding.  It''s a grotesque building but a good photograph.  6', '2005-01-20 05:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120868, 136700, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a very good composition, and takes every advantage of this happy juxtaposition.  7.</td>', 'This is a very good composition, and takes every advantage of this happy juxtaposition.  7.', '2005-01-20 05:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120870, 135743, 30364, '<td valign="top">Is it really that colour?  You''d get a hangover just going into it.  Nice detailed facade.  7.</td>', 'Is it really that colour?  You''d get a hangover just going into it.  Nice detailed facade.  7.', '2005-01-20 05:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120871, 136755, 30364, '<td valign="top">Mimimalist.  OK.  6.</td>', 'Mimimalist.  OK.  6.', '2005-01-20 05:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120872, 137146, 30364, '<td valign="top">You''re wright about that.  6.</td>', 'You''re wright about that.  6.', '2005-01-20 05:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120876, 135045, 30364, '<td valign="top">The tops (domes) of those minarets look like they''d be very colourful, especially against the sky.  How restrained of you to see it in B&amp;W.  I think there''s a bit too much frame &amp; not quite enough minaret.  But still good.  6.</td>', 'The tops (domes) of those minarets look like they''d be very colourful, especially against the sky.  How restrained of you to see it in B&W.  I think there''s a bit too much frame & not quite enough minaret.  But still good.  6.', '2005-01-20 05:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120878, 136989, 30364, '<td valign="top">Great visual effect, but at a small sacrifice of our learning much about the architecture of the building.  What I mean is that this is pretty much an architectural "detail" shot, but the detail shown gives little away about the character of the structure.  But it is still on-challenge, and a beautiful image.  7.</td>', 'Great visual effect, but at a small sacrifice of our learning much about the architecture of the building.  What I mean is that this is pretty much an architectural "detail" shot, but the detail shown gives little away about the character of the structure.  But it is still on-challenge, and a beautiful image.  7.', '2005-01-20 05:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120879, 137220, 30364, '<td valign="top">To me it''s more of a construction shot than an architectural shot.  So I can''t score it as highly as you''d like.  Sorry.  3.</td>', 'To me it''s more of a construction shot than an architectural shot.  So I can''t score it as highly as you''d like.  Sorry.  3.', '2005-01-20 05:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120882, 137118, 30364, '<td valign="top">Iceland again?  I don''t recognise the architecture but the skies look familiar.  Heavy, brooding feel to this shot, and an obviously organic feel to the building!  It''s also a very accomplished, artistic composition.   7.</td>', 'Iceland again?  I don''t recognise the architecture but the skies look familiar.  Heavy, brooding feel to this shot, and an obviously organic feel to the building!  It''s also a very accomplished, artistic composition.   7.', '2005-01-20 06:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120883, 136732, 30364, '<td valign="top">Mine won''t be a popular comment, but to me, everything this building had to say has been taken away by the processing of what would otherwise have been an appealing image.  I suppose the negative effect is suggestive of a blueprint, but I just can''t relate to the building that way.  Its lines are certainly faithfully rendered but its character is gone.  My problem. I guess.  Sorry I don''t like it, but I hope you''ll get plenty of support from elsewhere.  4.</td>', 'Mine won''t be a popular comment, but to me, everything this building had to say has been taken away by the processing of what would otherwise have been an appealing image.  I suppose the negative effect is suggestive of a blueprint, but I just can''t relate to the building that way.  Its lines are certainly faithfully rendered but its character is gone.  My problem. I guess.  Sorry I don''t like it, but I hope you''ll get plenty of support from elsewhere.  4.', '2005-01-20 06:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120884, 136663, 30222, '<td valign="top">great rhytm!<br/></td>', 'great rhytm!', '2005-01-20 06:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120885, 135276, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a novel perspective on this beautiful old bridge, making it look like a place to find vampires.  It''s a very striking image.  7.</td>', 'This is a novel perspective on this beautiful old bridge, making it look like a place to find vampires.  It''s a very striking image.  7.', '2005-01-20 06:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120887, 137086, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like looking at this photograph.  The body language of the man on the bicycle, and the absurd green "tree", add to my enjoyment of the architecture, rather than distracting from it.  8.</td>', 'I like looking at this photograph.  The body language of the man on the bicycle, and the absurd green "tree", add to my enjoyment of the architecture, rather than distracting from it.  8.', '2005-01-20 06:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120889, 136699, 30222, '<td valign="top">great design and the picture does justice to it</td>', 'great design and the picture does justice to it', '2005-01-20 06:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120895, 136595, 30857, '<td valign="top">Great picture!! Gaudi sure was a genious :).<br/>Picture is from Sagrada Familia, isn''t it?</td>', 'Great picture!! Gaudi sure was a genious :).Picture is from Sagrada Familia, isn''t it?', '2005-01-20 06:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120896, 137059, 30857, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition!</td>', 'Wonderful composition!', '2005-01-20 06:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120901, 135999, 30857, '<td valign="top">Love picture composition with the straight lines from the bridge kind of framing the city. And I like your decision, risky, of using a selective desat. <br/> <br/>Good job, one of my favorite pictures from this challenge.</td>', 'Love picture composition with the straight lines from the bridge kind of framing the city. And I like your decision, risky, of using a selective desat.  Good job, one of my favorite pictures from this challenge.', '2005-01-20 06:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120955, 136754, 18191, '<td valign="top">Wonderworks... went there when I was a little kid.. fun place!</td>', 'Wonderworks... went there when I was a little kid.. fun place!', '2005-01-20 07:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
