(1122324, 136346, 30364, '<td valign="top">I think these columns are not flattered by the wild tilt, nor by the peripheral distortion.  I realise, of course, that both effects were intentional, but they just don''t work for me.  Sorry.  4.</td>', 'I think these columns are not flattered by the wild tilt, nor by the peripheral distortion.  I realise, of course, that both effects were intentional, but they just don''t work for me.  Sorry.  4.', '2005-01-20 22:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
