(1122432, 137210, 28695, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, but the background is a little too bright for my tastes, especially since you went b/w.</td>', 'I like the subject, but the background is a little too bright for my tastes, especially since you went b/w.', '2005-01-20 23:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
