(1123049, 136998, 10686, '<td valign="top">I like the tension between the circle at the top of the dome and the blue ones on the wall.  Might consider a wider shot with the top circle a bit further into the frame, but this is still really nice.</td>', 'I like the tension between the circle at the top of the dome and the blue ones on the wall.  Might consider a wider shot with the top circle a bit further into the frame, but this is still really nice.', '2005-01-21 09:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123050, 136678, 10686, '<td valign="top">WOW is that vivid.</td>', 'WOW is that vivid.', '2005-01-21 09:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123052, 136699, 10686, '<td valign="top">Very cool. The darkness and blueness go well with the subject and create an ominous feel to the whole scene.</td>', 'Very cool. The darkness and blueness go well with the subject and create an ominous feel to the whole scene.', '2005-01-21 09:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123054, 137114, 10686, '<td valign="top">Simple, clean. Dunno if you considered a less balanced composition or not,, but, that might make this a bit more dynamic.</td>', 'Simple, clean. Dunno if you considered a less balanced composition or not,, but, that might make this a bit more dynamic.', '2005-01-21 09:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123055, 137020, 10686, '<td valign="top">Very nice. My only suggestion would be to consider a wider aspect ratio shot There''s a lot of negative space above the building and it seems cramped on the sides.</td>', 'Very nice. My only suggestion would be to consider a wider aspect ratio shot There''s a lot of negative space above the building and it seems cramped on the sides.', '2005-01-21 09:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123061, 137105, 10686, '<td valign="top">Could stand a bit of perspective correction, but I love the symmetry, it''s almost perfect</td>', 'Could stand a bit of perspective correction, but I love the symmetry, it''s almost perfect', '2005-01-21 09:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123065, 137002, 10686, '<td valign="top">This totally reminds me of my friends who were Architecture students. They spent countless hours building little models like this. Very much in line with the challenge</td>', 'This totally reminds me of my friends who were Architecture students. They spent countless hours building little models like this. Very much in line with the challenge', '2005-01-21 09:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123067, 137158, 10686, '<td valign="top">The lone person studying makes this -9</td>', 'The lone person studying makes this -9', '2005-01-21 09:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123115, 137231, 25378, '<td valign="top">A good image, but it seems a little tilted. 6</td>', 'A good image, but it seems a little tilted. 6', '2005-01-21 10:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123341, 136598, 30818, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the clouds, but I would''ve like to have seen the house more of the focus point of the photo.</td>', 'Great shot of the clouds, but I would''ve like to have seen the house more of the focus point of the photo.', '2005-01-21 12:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123348, 137224, 30818, '<td valign="top">Your main subject is too dark...  My eyes went straight to the sign, which is not so impressive for architecture!</td>', 'Your main subject is too dark...  My eyes went straight to the sign, which is not so impressive for architecture!', '2005-01-21 12:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123351, 136663, 4517, '<td valign="top">Very good. 9</td>', 'Very good. 9', '2005-01-21 12:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123377, 136598, 4517, '<td valign="top">You win the prize for the smallest piece of architecture, great sky.</td>', 'You win the prize for the smallest piece of architecture, great sky.', '2005-01-21 12:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123492, 137120, 30818, '<td valign="top">You pretty much shot the whole building and then cut off the top!  Partial shots are fine, but it''s a bit unfinished when you see the whole building (minus the very top).</td>', 'You pretty much shot the whole building and then cut off the top!  Partial shots are fine, but it''s a bit unfinished when you see the whole building (minus the very top).', '2005-01-21 13:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123504, 135850, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like this very much, so simple but so effective. I would have liked the corner to be totally vertical and I would have cloned out the leaves in the bottom right corner.  -8</td>', 'I like this very much, so simple but so effective. I would have liked the corner to be totally vertical and I would have cloned out the leaves in the bottom right corner.  -8', '2005-01-21 13:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123546, 137085, 26756, '<td valign="top">Beautiful exposure and detail, and not the blurry photo that most people take of a cieling like this.</td>', 'Beautiful exposure and detail, and not the blurry photo that most people take of a cieling like this.', '2005-01-21 13:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123551, 135877, 26756, '<td valign="top">Remarkable color contrasts, lines and composition.  I''m not a skyscraper fan but I love what you''ve done here.  9</td>', 'Remarkable color contrasts, lines and composition.  I''m not a skyscraper fan but I love what you''ve done here.  9', '2005-01-21 13:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123582, 135743, 10686, '<td valign="top">Let''s go! I''ll buy the first pint!</td>', 'Let''s go! I''ll buy the first pint!', '2005-01-21 14:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123598, 136755, 30861, '<td valign="top">I am very pleased to see someone dealing effectively with minimalist strucutral elements. This is a stunningly effective B/W composition. I hope it''s not voted down as far as I fear it will be. I wish you''d used a little perspective correction in ''shopping it to get true verticals left and right; very easy to do.</td>', 'I am very pleased to see someone dealing effectively with minimalist strucutral elements. This is a stunningly effective B/W composition. I hope it''s not voted down as far as I fear it will be. I wish you''d used a little perspective correction in ''shopping it to get true verticals left and right; very easy to do.', '2005-01-21 14:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123602, 135897, 10686, '<td valign="top">why so small?</td>', 'why so small?', '2005-01-21 14:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123605, 135850, 10686, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the way the corner of the building touches the frame</td>', 'I don''t care for the way the corner of the building touches the frame', '2005-01-21 14:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123611, 136880, 30861, '<td valign="top">chaotic composition of an incredible building. I don''t think the angle is workign well for you. I also wish the figure right separated from the background shadow; that would help a whoile lot.</td>', 'chaotic composition of an incredible building. I don''t think the angle is workign well for you. I also wish the figure right separated from the background shadow; that would help a whoile lot.', '2005-01-21 14:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123618, 136394, 30861, '<td valign="top">Really nice job of rendering tonalities, the off-center aspect of this view is intriguing, but somehow it doesn''t quite come together for me as more than a medium-strong image.</td>', 'Really nice job of rendering tonalities, the off-center aspect of this view is intriguing, but somehow it doesn''t quite come together for me as more than a medium-strong image.', '2005-01-21 14:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123622, 136464, 30861, '<td valign="top">Blown highlights, overalls ense of blurriness detract from this intriguing shot.</td>', 'Blown highlights, overalls ense of blurriness detract from this intriguing shot.', '2005-01-21 14:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123626, 136732, 30861, '<td valign="top">I rather like it, myself, but I bet it gets hammered. I give you points for courage...</td>', 'I rather like it, myself, but I bet it gets hammered. I give you points for courage...', '2005-01-21 14:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123629, 137214, 30861, '<td valign="top">Sweet &amp; smooth. If ONLY we could see the point of the "wing"...</td>', 'Sweet & smooth. If ONLY we could see the point of the "wing"...', '2005-01-21 14:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123715, 135276, 25486, '<td valign="top">A clear winner as far as I''m concerned. Great viewpoint, excellent use of the camera angle.  All too easy to end up with a burnt out sky but you''ve held it well and managed to retain detail in the stonework.  This is engineering and architecture in one.<br/> <br/>An absolutely fabulous shot, very well done. Only a ten will do I''m afraid.<br/> <br/>Edited for typo!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-24 09:37:58.</i></td>', 'A clear winner as far as I''m concerned. Great viewpoint, excellent use of the camera angle.  All too easy to end up with a burnt out sky but you''ve held it well and managed to retain detail in the stonework.  This is engineering and architecture in one. An absolutely fabulous shot, very well done. Only a ten will do I''m afraid. Edited for typo!', '2005-01-21 15:14:54.000000', '2005-01-24 09:37:58.000000', 1),
(1123720, 137060, 25486, '<td valign="top">An excellent study.  I love the grainy feel to it, yet the roof seems very smooth and silky.  The lamp has this amazing metalic sheen.  The lighting is wonderful giving a gothic feel to it.<br/> <br/>I might have removed the stains on the window with the clone tool but apart from that absolutely great.  Very well done just beaten by one other shot in my opinion, a worthy 8 from me.</td>', 'An excellent study.  I love the grainy feel to it, yet the roof seems very smooth and silky.  The lamp has this amazing metalic sheen.  The lighting is wonderful giving a gothic feel to it. I might have removed the stains on the window with the clone tool but apart from that absolutely great.  Very well done just beaten by one other shot in my opinion, a worthy 8 from me.', '2005-01-21 15:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123725, 136699, 25486, '<td valign="top">Just too much of the blue wash I feel.  It almost makes it but I thought it was a bit too overpowering.<br/> <br/>Its and excellent viewpoint with a great leadin to the towering main subject which you have placed at just the right position.<br/> <br/>Just a lighter application of the blue with some grain I think wouls have improved it.  But an excellently framed and well thought out shot.</td>', 'Just too much of the blue wash I feel.  It almost makes it but I thought it was a bit too overpowering. Its and excellent viewpoint with a great leadin to the towering main subject which you have placed at just the right position. Just a lighter application of the blue with some grain I think wouls have improved it.  But an excellently framed and well thought out shot.', '2005-01-21 15:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123731, 136148, 25486, '<td valign="top">I have been lucky enought to have visited SF and this exact place.  I know how difficult it is to make a great shot because the architecture is of truly grand proportions.  Just trying to fit it into the frame is difficult.<br/> <br/>I think you may have faired better with an abstract view showing part of the structure.  Presented in this way its a bit central, straight down the middle and becomes just a bit predictable.  The sky is totally blown out because of the difficult contrast levels.  All of which makes me feel an abstract view would have faired better.<br/> <br/>Still an impressive piece of "real" architecture, well done.</td>', 'I have been lucky enought to have visited SF and this exact place.  I know how difficult it is to make a great shot because the architecture is of truly grand proportions.  Just trying to fit it into the frame is difficult. I think you may have faired better with an abstract view showing part of the structure.  Presented in this way its a bit central, straight down the middle and becomes just a bit predictable.  The sky is totally blown out because of the difficult contrast levels.  All of which makes me feel an abstract view would have faired better. Still an impressive piece of "real" architecture, well done.', '2005-01-21 15:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123737, 135691, 25486, '<td valign="top">This is a shot which I feel almost made it. I find it frustrating to look at because I feel as though I''m not being allowed to see more of the interesting parts of the scene.  In short I think there should have been a bit less of the sky and more of the structure.  The vapor trails in my opinion are distracting and should have been removed.<br/> <br/>The lighting being reflected on the underside of the "roof" is wonderful, lighting is what makes or breaks a shot.  Thanks for thinking creatively, well done.</td>', 'This is a shot which I feel almost made it. I find it frustrating to look at because I feel as though I''m not being allowed to see more of the interesting parts of the scene.  In short I think there should have been a bit less of the sky and more of the structure.  The vapor trails in my opinion are distracting and should have been removed. The lighting being reflected on the underside of the "roof" is wonderful, lighting is what makes or breaks a shot.  Thanks for thinking creatively, well done.', '2005-01-21 15:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123738, 136762, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, colourful well light, the shadows give it some depth.  I think however that the steam? from the buildings compete too much with the architecture and it almost wins as the main focus of the shot.<br/> <br/>The featureless foreground would be better cropped off in my opinion as well as some of the sky which just emphasises the steam.<br/> <br/>Well spotted and well done for taking the opportunity to shoot it.</td>', 'Nice shot, colourful well light, the shadows give it some depth.  I think however that the steam? from the buildings compete too much with the architecture and it almost wins as the main focus of the shot. The featureless foreground would be better cropped off in my opinion as well as some of the sky which just emphasises the steam. Well spotted and well done for taking the opportunity to shoot it.', '2005-01-21 15:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123748, 136460, 25486, '<td valign="top">This was the first shot that came up when I started voting on this challenge, a nice opening.  The colours are wonderful and its in a beautiful setting.  But you know what, in my opinion the surrounding country would have been better left out of it.<br/> <br/>That broken roof would need to be in somehow as well as the peeling paint from the walls etc.  But what I mean is a close up, an abstract view which gives a "suggestion" of the surroundings would have been better I think.<br/> <br/>I''m probably just as guilty of trying to cram too much into the viewfinder when just the hint or suggestion of it will do.  The viewers imagination can create a much better scene that you can capture if you just give them the hints to work with.</td>', 'This was the first shot that came up when I started voting on this challenge, a nice opening.  The colours are wonderful and its in a beautiful setting.  But you know what, in my opinion the surrounding country would have been better left out of it. That broken roof would need to be in somehow as well as the peeling paint from the walls etc.  But what I mean is a close up, an abstract view which gives a "suggestion" of the surroundings would have been better I think. I''m probably just as guilty of trying to cram too much into the viewfinder when just the hint or suggestion of it will do.  The viewers imagination can create a much better scene that you can capture if you just give them the hints to work with.', '2005-01-21 15:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123755, 135999, 25486, '<td valign="top">Had to comment on this one, I just love it.  The colurs on the bridge structure and the hillside contrast magnificently with the greyscale of the city.  The boat just adds that bit of interest to carry you over the gap between the two.<br/> <br/>What a fabulous viewpoint on what was a fabulous day.  I have visited SF but didn''t get to that side of the bridge.  It brings back memories for me, thanks.</td>', 'Had to comment on this one, I just love it.  The colurs on the bridge structure and the hillside contrast magnificently with the greyscale of the city.  The boat just adds that bit of interest to carry you over the gap between the two. What a fabulous viewpoint on what was a fabulous day.  I have visited SF but didn''t get to that side of the bridge.  It brings back memories for me, thanks.', '2005-01-21 15:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123761, 137118, 25486, '<td valign="top">My type of shot.  One which I would be proud to call my own.  I do think however that a little closer to the structure, giving it more focus. making it more the focal point would have been better in this instance.  Perhaps it wasn''t shot just for this challenge?  You would have had to changhe the angle to keep the post in the shot so maybe it wouldn''t have worked so well, I''m not sure.<br/> <br/>The sky is ok, I think we''d always like more detail in the sky but its very difficult with a constrasty shot like this.  The darkening around the top works well enough.  Very well done.</td>', 'My type of shot.  One which I would be proud to call my own.  I do think however that a little closer to the structure, giving it more focus. making it more the focal point would have been better in this instance.  Perhaps it wasn''t shot just for this challenge?  You would have had to changhe the angle to keep the post in the shot so maybe it wouldn''t have worked so well, I''m not sure. The sky is ok, I think we''d always like more detail in the sky but its very difficult with a constrasty shot like this.  The darkening around the top works well enough.  Very well done.', '2005-01-21 15:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123796, 136378, 32438, '<td valign="top">Sweet!!!!</td>', 'Sweet!!!!', '2005-01-21 16:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123902, 137091, 20941, '<td valign="top">Great shot, excellent composition along with your title making this  one of my favorites in this challenge...bumping to 10</td>', 'Great shot, excellent composition along with your title making this  one of my favorites in this challenge...bumping to 10', '2005-01-21 17:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123909, 136936, 20941, '<td valign="top">great shot with a wonderful viewpoint bumping up</td>', 'great shot with a wonderful viewpoint bumping up', '2005-01-21 17:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124422, 136058, 10686, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but the tilt makes it look as though the building is sliding off the hill and the blown out sky is boring.</td>', 'Sorry, but the tilt makes it look as though the building is sliding off the hill and the blown out sky is boring.', '2005-01-21 22:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124442, 135999, 10686, '<td valign="top">Not sure I care for the fade, but I like the shot well enough anyway</td>', 'Not sure I care for the fade, but I like the shot well enough anyway', '2005-01-21 22:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124447, 135521, 10686, '<td valign="top">A truly pedestrian subject</td>', 'A truly pedestrian subject', '2005-01-21 22:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124449, 136994, 10686, '<td valign="top">Bizarro</td>', 'Bizarro', '2005-01-21 22:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124452, 137231, 10686, '<td valign="top">This would be better if you had corrected the perspective</td>', 'This would be better if you had corrected the perspective', '2005-01-21 22:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124454, 137146, 10686, '<td valign="top">Welcome to Los Angeles International Airport</td>', 'Welcome to Los Angeles International Airport', '2005-01-21 22:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124458, 136976, 10686, '<td valign="top">This just blows me away....................................10</td>', 'This just blows me away....................................10', '2005-01-21 22:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124461, 136901, 10686, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the Sheik lives here anymore</td>', 'I don''t think the Sheik lives here anymore', '2005-01-21 22:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124469, 137091, 10686, '<td valign="top">Maybe not so crowded at the top would be better. Still, an interesting angular study. 7</td>', 'Maybe not so crowded at the top would be better. Still, an interesting angular study. 7', '2005-01-21 22:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124472, 136467, 10686, '<td valign="top">Needs contrast and you should clone out the bird poop</td>', 'Needs contrast and you should clone out the bird poop', '2005-01-21 22:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124474, 136950, 10686, '<td valign="top">Seems kinda crowded at the top</td>', 'Seems kinda crowded at the top', '2005-01-21 22:31:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1124476, 136900, 10686, '<td valign="top">can''t put my finger on exactly why, but I do like it</td>', 'can''t put my finger on exactly why, but I do like it', '2005-01-21 22:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124483, 136760, 10686, '<td valign="top">FORE!!!!!!</td>', 'FORE!!!!!!', '2005-01-21 22:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124492, 137131, 10686, '<td valign="top">Sky could maybe be a bit bluer, but that''s about all I can say other than "Great Work!"</td>', 'Sky could maybe be a bit bluer, but that''s about all I can say other than "Great Work!"', '2005-01-21 22:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124514, 137117, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Blur can be removed in post processing, but perhaps a wider angle lens or longer exposure with smaller aperture would allow greater depth of field.  I would think of a building with reflective glass as a large mirror and I wonder if you were taking a picture of a mirror whether you would choose a blue sky as the reflected object?  Here, the mirror is broken up with white stripes, so the analogy is not quite that easy, as this photo has the feel of greek tiles.  I would also prefer a different point of view which is different than that of anyone approaching the building and looking up at it.  A 5.<br/></td>', 'Nice colors.  Blur can be removed in post processing, but perhaps a wider angle lens or longer exposure with smaller aperture would allow greater depth of field.  I would think of a building with reflective glass as a large mirror and I wonder if you were taking a picture of a mirror whether you would choose a blue sky as the reflected object?  Here, the mirror is broken up with white stripes, so the analogy is not quite that easy, as this photo has the feel of greek tiles.  I would also prefer a different point of view which is different than that of anyone approaching the building and looking up at it.  A 5.', '2005-01-21 22:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124521, 136992, 21202, '<td valign="top">I really like the point of view and contrast in architectural periods.  An 8.</td>', 'I really like the point of view and contrast in architectural periods.  An 8.', '2005-01-21 23:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124529, 136796, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice angle, nice structure.  Suggestions: 1. add border after reducing to submission size to avoid blurred border.  2.  sharpen again after reducing to submission size.  3. Sharpen by converting to hsl, then sharpen lightness image only, then convert back to srgb.  A 6.</td>', 'Nice angle, nice structure.  Suggestions: 1. add border after reducing to submission size to avoid blurred border.  2.  sharpen again after reducing to submission size.  3. Sharpen by converting to hsl, then sharpen lightness image only, then convert back to srgb.  A 6.', '2005-01-21 23:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124534, 136782, 21202, '<td valign="top">This is a nice clean sharp image.  The perspectives used here give me the sense that the building rather than reaching for the sky is actually collapsing or falling to the right.  The lighting on this side of the building produces some heavy shadows and a rather dim subject against a bright sky.  A 7.</td>', 'This is a nice clean sharp image.  The perspectives used here give me the sense that the building rather than reaching for the sky is actually collapsing or falling to the right.  The lighting on this side of the building produces some heavy shadows and a rather dim subject against a bright sky.  A 7.', '2005-01-21 23:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124547, 136989, 21202, '<td valign="top">Good viewpoint indeed.  Also, very interesting counter point of reflected builiding against subject building.  I would consider cropping off the right side where the sky is reflected.   A 9.</td>', 'Good viewpoint indeed.  Also, very interesting counter point of reflected builiding against subject building.  I would consider cropping off the right side where the sky is reflected.   A 9.', '2005-01-21 23:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124549, 137224, 21202, '<td valign="top">Great exposure and colors.  A higher vantage point would  be useful if such exists.  A 7.</td>', 'Great exposure and colors.  A higher vantage point would  be useful if such exists.  A 7.', '2005-01-21 23:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124550, 137033, 31213, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle!</td>', 'Interesting angle!', '2005-01-21 23:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124556, 135999, 32457, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot</td>', 'Fantastic shot', '2005-01-21 23:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124578, 136598, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice clouds, nice lighting of clouds, and nice reflection.  However, the house is less than 60 pixels in this format which is insufficient for an architectural study.  A 3.</td>', 'Nice clouds, nice lighting of clouds, and nice reflection.  However, the house is less than 60 pixels in this format which is insufficient for an architectural study.  A 3.', '2005-01-22 00:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124580, 136656, 21202, '<td valign="top">Great subject for winter architecture.  This was obviously taken on a stormy day under very low light conditions.  More light would certainly have raised my appraisal of this picture.  A 4.</td>', 'Great subject for winter architecture.  This was obviously taken on a stormy day under very low light conditions.  More light would certainly have raised my appraisal of this picture.  A 4.', '2005-01-22 00:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124686, 136324, 16241, '<td valign="top">this is cool, i could paint this.</td>', 'this is cool, i could paint this.', '2005-01-22 01:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124689, 135949, 16241, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful man, like the title too</td>', 'this is beautiful man, like the title too', '2005-01-22 02:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124694, 135276, 16241, '<td valign="top">never seen brooklyn bridge look like this before :)  <br/>bump from 8 to 9<br/>now will you please tick my comment as helpful... ! ;</td>', 'never seen brooklyn bridge look like this before :)  bump from 8 to 9now will you please tick my comment as helpful... ! ;', '2005-01-22 02:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124736, 135276, 30214, '<td valign="top">great moody shot</td>', 'great moody shot', '2005-01-22 03:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124738, 137131, 30214, '<td valign="top">great airy feel, matching the subject perfecty. my favorite in the challenge</td>', 'great airy feel, matching the subject perfecty. my favorite in the challenge', '2005-01-22 03:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124740, 137040, 30214, '<td valign="top">i love the tones and the overall mood of the photo. one of my favorites</td>', 'i love the tones and the overall mood of the photo. one of my favorites', '2005-01-22 03:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124743, 136976, 30214, '<td valign="top">great mood in this photo is created by dramatic lighting. one of my favorites</td>', 'great mood in this photo is created by dramatic lighting. one of my favorites', '2005-01-22 03:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124744, 135999, 30214, '<td valign="top">i am not sure i like the selective desaturation of the background (feels a little like a stage set), but a great composition.</td>', 'i am not sure i like the selective desaturation of the background (feels a little like a stage set), but a great composition.', '2005-01-22 03:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124751, 136875, 30214, '<td valign="top">great capture. i wish the sky was a little darker</td>', 'great capture. i wish the sky was a little darker', '2005-01-22 04:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124797, 137040, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, but it seems to lack a bit of impact in this treatment ... I know you were going for an ancient feel to the image, but I think your point would have been better made if you''d let the ruined building appear against the greater contrast of naturally coloured surroundings (grass, sky, etc).  5.</td>', 'I like the subject, but it seems to lack a bit of impact in this treatment ... I know you were going for an ancient feel to the image, but I think your point would have been better made if you''d let the ruined building appear against the greater contrast of naturally coloured surroundings (grass, sky, etc).  5.', '2005-01-22 04:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
