(1125852, 137083, 32491, '<td valign="top">I love the placement of the subject in this picture. Not too high, not too low, perfectly cutting across the picture. It makes it streamline, and smooth, and  gives off the feeling of fluidity. The darkening grey of the sky also adds to the dimension of the photo.<br/> <br/>Being a left-to-right reader I especially enjoy the perspective. If this was taken in mirror image I don''t think I''d like it as much.<br/> <br/> <br/>My only slight negative is that  I''m not too keen on the hill to the right. It breaks the fluidity of the architecture and sky and it looks a bit choppy.<br/> <br/>Still a great picture though.</td>', 'I love the placement of the subject in this picture. Not too high, not too low, perfectly cutting across the picture. It makes it streamline, and smooth, and  gives off the feeling of fluidity. The darkening grey of the sky also adds to the dimension of the photo. Being a left-to-right reader I especially enjoy the perspective. If this was taken in mirror image I don''t think I''d like it as much.  My only slight negative is that  I''m not too keen on the hill to the right. It breaks the fluidity of the architecture and sky and it looks a bit choppy. Still a great picture though.', '2005-01-22 19:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
