(1127234, 136622, 27763, '<td valign="top">Great viewpoint.  It''s great that you got down low (?) to include all of that fabulous foreground.  I think it would look better without the buildings in the far background, but there''s nothing that you could have done about that!  Good job.</td>', 'Great viewpoint.  It''s great that you got down low (?) to include all of that fabulous foreground.  I think it would look better without the buildings in the far background, but there''s nothing that you could have done about that!  Good job.', '2005-01-23 16:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127249, 137148, 27763, '<td valign="top">This photo feels "spooky" to me.  In a good way, I mean.  I like it.  Is this sepia, or duotone of some sort?  Nice touch with the darkened edges.  And I don''t care what anyone says about borders.   I like the border, too.</td>', 'This photo feels "spooky" to me.  In a good way, I mean.  I like it.  Is this sepia, or duotone of some sort?  Nice touch with the darkened edges.  And I don''t care what anyone says about borders.   I like the border, too.', '2005-01-23 16:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127250, 137108, 27763, '<td valign="top">Nice job with this.  I love the tones of the sky and building.</td>', 'Nice job with this.  I love the tones of the sky and building.', '2005-01-23 16:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127257, 136029, 27763, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors and lighting.  I think it would be even better without seeing any sky in the background.   I bet a simple, straight-on shot of this building would look great, too.  Nice job.</td>', 'Awesome colors and lighting.  I think it would be even better without seeing any sky in the background.   I bet a simple, straight-on shot of this building would look great, too.  Nice job.', '2005-01-23 16:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
