(1127266, 135752, 7560, '<td valign="top">Possibly my favorite shot of the challenge. This show the subject in a new and innovative way. Good colors, nice sharp image in the water. I love these kinds of shots, and they are fun to try and get. You''ve done a great job here. 10</td>', 'Possibly my favorite shot of the challenge. This show the subject in a new and innovative way. Good colors, nice sharp image in the water. I love these kinds of shots, and they are fun to try and get. You''ve done a great job here. 10', '2005-01-23 16:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
