(1127280, 135999, 7560, '<td valign="top">Interesting selective desat here. I actually like it. Nice strong color contrast, and I think it makes the image more interesting. Kinda gets me thinking of foggy SanFran. I also like the angle on the bridge. This isn''t your typical bridge shot. 9</td>', 'Interesting selective desat here. I actually like it. Nice strong color contrast, and I think it makes the image more interesting. Kinda gets me thinking of foggy SanFran. I also like the angle on the bridge. This isn''t your typical bridge shot. 9', '2005-01-23 16:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127283, 137131, 27763, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting, and very interesting composition.  The architectural style of this building reminds me of the photo of the building that ribboned in the black and white challenge.  I think I would have cropped a bit more off the left so that it matched the right side, since this is clearly (?) intended to be a centered composition.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting, and very interesting composition.  The architectural style of this building reminds me of the photo of the building that ribboned in the black and white challenge.  I think I would have cropped a bit more off the left so that it matched the right side, since this is clearly (?) intended to be a centered composition.', '2005-01-23 16:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127287, 136460, 27763, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  I like that the title of the photo really emphasizes the details of the image, rather than the main subject itself.  I''m curious to find out where this is located.</td>', 'Lovely.  I like that the title of the photo really emphasizes the details of the image, rather than the main subject itself.  I''m curious to find out where this is located.', '2005-01-23 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
