(1127306, 137207, 27763, '<td valign="top">I love pueblo architecture.  Nice lighting.  I''m curious to find out where this is located.</td>', 'I love pueblo architecture.  Nice lighting.  I''m curious to find out where this is located.', '2005-01-23 16:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127315, 137146, 27763, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title (are you saying that Frank Lloyd Wright designed this, but you think that it is ugly?).  I think it''s a beautiful structure, and not just because I''m from Chicago!  Maybe you are referring to the fact that some of his "wilder" designs were known to have some functional/practical problems.</td>', 'I don''t understand the title (are you saying that Frank Lloyd Wright designed this, but you think that it is ugly?).  I think it''s a beautiful structure, and not just because I''m from Chicago!  Maybe you are referring to the fact that some of his "wilder" designs were known to have some functional/practical problems.', '2005-01-23 17:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127316, 136919, 27763, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple, with very interesting lighting.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice and simple, with very interesting lighting.  Good job.', '2005-01-23 17:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127327, 137169, 28750, '<td valign="top">hvar hef ég séð þessa hús áður?<br/>mjög flott mynd vonadi lendir hún í efstu sætum</td>', 'hvar hef ég séð þessa hús áður?mjög flott mynd vonadi lendir hún í efstu sætum', '2005-01-23 17:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127361, 137204, 27763, '<td valign="top">I like this kind of gritty, industrial architecture.    This photo has about as much sky as foreground (the pavement).  I think it might be more dramatic if you moved the building up in the frame and included more pavement in the foreground, OR if you moved the building down in the frame so that the pavement is not included and you have much more sky.  Just a thought.  One more thing... have you tried converting this to black and white?</td>', 'I like this kind of gritty, industrial architecture.    This photo has about as much sky as foreground (the pavement).  I think it might be more dramatic if you moved the building up in the frame and included more pavement in the foreground, OR if you moved the building down in the frame so that the pavement is not included and you have much more sky.  Just a thought.  One more thing... have you tried converting this to black and white?', '2005-01-23 17:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127366, 135696, 27763, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I''ve never seen anything like this.  This photo may get voted down for not being very "slick", but this is definitely a good record of an interesting bit of architectural history.</td>', 'Wow.  I''ve never seen anything like this.  This photo may get voted down for not being very "slick", but this is definitely a good record of an interesting bit of architectural history.', '2005-01-23 17:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127368, 137118, 2158, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2005-01-23 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127371, 136762, 7560, '<td valign="top">I love this skyline.  THe steam really adds to the composition. Looks like a cold one there. 7</td>', 'I love this skyline.  THe steam really adds to the composition. Looks like a cold one there. 7', '2005-01-23 17:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127372, 137207, 7560, '<td valign="top">Nice subject choice. My major problem with the shot is the light. Winter produces harsh light to begin with. At altitude, that light is even harder. I''d try shooting this just pre-sunrise, or sunset. That will give you a better quality of light. 6</td>', 'Nice subject choice. My major problem with the shot is the light. Winter produces harsh light to begin with. At altitude, that light is even harder. I''d try shooting this just pre-sunrise, or sunset. That will give you a better quality of light. 6', '2005-01-23 17:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127377, 137158, 7560, '<td valign="top">I think this shot might benifit from a bit more symmetry in the composition. I like the sense of scale. Very cool studyhall. :)</td>', 'I think this shot might benifit from a bit more symmetry in the composition. I like the sense of scale. Very cool studyhall. :)', '2005-01-23 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127380, 137210, 7560, '<td valign="top">I like the subject choice here. My chief problem is that the image seems a bit flat. By that I mean everything kind of blends into itself. I''m still struggling myself with creating more dynamic range in my black and white images- so I''m not sure what suggestions I can make that will help. It might be work trying it out with some different post processing options (duotone maybe).</td>', 'I like the subject choice here. My chief problem is that the image seems a bit flat. By that I mean everything kind of blends into itself. I''m still struggling myself with creating more dynamic range in my black and white images- so I''m not sure what suggestions I can make that will help. It might be work trying it out with some different post processing options (duotone maybe).', '2005-01-23 18:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127387, 137135, 7560, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome building. One of my new favorites in DC. The only major issue with this shot is the light. Way too flat to get the building to pop. It''s probably worth getting up before sunrise or sunset to see if you can get better color.</td>', 'This is an awesome building. One of my new favorites in DC. The only major issue with this shot is the light. Way too flat to get the building to pop. It''s probably worth getting up before sunrise or sunset to see if you can get better color.', '2005-01-23 18:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127388, 136919, 7560, '<td valign="top">I love the shadows on the building, but the tree branches make the shot a bit busy.</td>', 'I love the shadows on the building, but the tree branches make the shot a bit busy.', '2005-01-23 18:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127395, 136188, 27847, '<td valign="top">Very gorgeous shot, I love it. They don''t build them like they used to. Only think I would have improved is corrected the prespective of the shot, when ever you shoot anything with the upwards perspective the shot needs to be corrected. The top of the shot should be pulled outwards on both sides to straighten it out a bit. It would also correct that ceiling/roof circle, just because it has a bit of the egg shape right now... but still love it.</td>', 'Very gorgeous shot, I love it. They don''t build them like they used to. Only think I would have improved is corrected the prespective of the shot, when ever you shoot anything with the upwards perspective the shot needs to be corrected. The top of the shot should be pulled outwards on both sides to straighten it out a bit. It would also correct that ceiling/roof circle, just because it has a bit of the egg shape right now... but still love it.', '2005-01-23 18:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127402, 137112, 27847, '<td valign="top">Great photo, interesting building. Too bad about the boring sky but that can''t be helped.</td>', 'Great photo, interesting building. Too bad about the boring sky but that can''t be helped.', '2005-01-23 18:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127404, 137146, 27847, '<td valign="top">Great capture! Love that you paid attention to making sure the building is perfectly straight in this photo (can tell by looking at the bottom railing, runs perfectly on straight). Also, great sky, just would have been a little plain without the clouds but you got them in there.</td>', 'Great capture! Love that you paid attention to making sure the building is perfectly straight in this photo (can tell by looking at the bottom railing, runs perfectly on straight). Also, great sky, just would have been a little plain without the clouds but you got them in there.', '2005-01-23 18:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127407, 136623, 27847, '<td valign="top">I would have like this shot a lot more if I saw a bit less of that grass, a little more crop would have made this picture a lot better in my opinion.</td>', 'I would have like this shot a lot more if I saw a bit less of that grass, a little more crop would have made this picture a lot better in my opinion.', '2005-01-23 18:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127411, 136942, 7560, '<td valign="top">There are several things going on with this image. First off, it''s not fitting into a classical concept of architectue. Second, there''s a great deal of visual clutter. Between the trees in the back, powerlines, and objects in the garage- there''s nothing for my eyes to settle on. Third, the light is very flat- typical of winter photography. Ways to correct that include shooting at sunries or sunset. These components together give the image a "snapshot" feel. Some suggestions for improvement would be: get closer- maybe look up at  a corner and wall element? The key is trying to control the shot as much as you can. That control makes the difference between a snapshot and a more interesting composition. Very solid effort though!</td>', 'There are several things going on with this image. First off, it''s not fitting into a classical concept of architectue. Second, there''s a great deal of visual clutter. Between the trees in the back, powerlines, and objects in the garage- there''s nothing for my eyes to settle on. Third, the light is very flat- typical of winter photography. Ways to correct that include shooting at sunries or sunset. These components together give the image a "snapshot" feel. Some suggestions for improvement would be: get closer- maybe look up at  a corner and wall element? The key is trying to control the shot as much as you can. That control makes the difference between a snapshot and a more interesting composition. Very solid effort though!', '2005-01-23 18:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127414, 136754, 27847, '<td valign="top">Should I be fliping my monitor around? OK... I''ve never seen and/or heard of a building like this. Very intersting and a great capture. Only think I would have suggested is maybe getting this picture a little earlier in the morning when not so many people were out, they distract the eyes from the main subject. Still great capture.</td>', 'Should I be fliping my monitor around? OK... I''ve never seen and/or heard of a building like this. Very intersting and a great capture. Only think I would have suggested is maybe getting this picture a little earlier in the morning when not so many people were out, they distract the eyes from the main subject. Still great capture.', '2005-01-23 18:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127423, 136475, 27847, '<td valign="top">Interesing perspective, it''s really too bad that my eyes are drawn towards the over exposed sun/reflection on the windows in the center. But still I like the shot.</td>', 'Interesing perspective, it''s really too bad that my eyes are drawn towards the over exposed sun/reflection on the windows in the center. But still I like the shot.', '2005-01-23 18:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127434, 136700, 7560, '<td valign="top">This would be an awesome shot at a different time of day. The mid-day light is way too harsh. Excellent composition, and I like the subject. Try reshooting at sunset.</td>', 'This would be an awesome shot at a different time of day. The mid-day light is way too harsh. Excellent composition, and I like the subject. Try reshooting at sunset.', '2005-01-23 18:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127435, 136912, 18080, '<td valign="top">10<br/>if i could give it more i would<br/>love this shot<br/>should be the winner<br/>well done</td>', '10if i could give it more i wouldlove this shotshould be the winnerwell done', '2005-01-23 18:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127437, 136976, 18080, '<td valign="top">10<br/>fab<br/>good luck</td>', '10fabgood luck', '2005-01-23 18:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127452, 137220, 7560, '<td valign="top">Very good job getting close and using a different POV in this shot. Not sure I like all the lines, it makes the overall image feel busy.</td>', 'Very good job getting close and using a different POV in this shot. Not sure I like all the lines, it makes the overall image feel busy.', '2005-01-23 18:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127461, 136030, 7560, '<td valign="top">I love the lines in this shot. I can''t wait to find out what it is.</td>', 'I love the lines in this shot. I can''t wait to find out what it is.', '2005-01-23 19:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127481, 137059, 25742, '<td valign="top">neat idea. Hope you''re doing well in this.</td>', 'neat idea. Hope you''re doing well in this.', '2005-01-23 19:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127482, 137238, 24579, '<td valign="top">Nice. Would have liked to have seen it cropped closer and in colour. Such a cool building. 7</td>', 'Nice. Would have liked to have seen it cropped closer and in colour. Such a cool building. 7', '2005-01-23 19:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127484, 136902, 24579, '<td valign="top">Go the Queenslander..</td>', 'Go the Queenslander..', '2005-01-23 19:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127488, 135849, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dream home. nice shot</td>', 'Beautiful dream home. nice shot', '2005-01-23 19:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127490, 137005, 489, '<td valign="top">The sun flare is more distracting than accentuating. Nice shot regardless.</td>', 'The sun flare is more distracting than accentuating. Nice shot regardless.', '2005-01-23 19:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127491, 137059, 489, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and form.</td>', 'Nice lines and form.', '2005-01-23 19:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127495, 136681, 489, '<td valign="top">I like the mood in the shot.</td>', 'I like the mood in the shot.', '2005-01-23 19:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127496, 136936, 489, '<td valign="top">In the center spire,  I would either show a little more detail or silhouette it entirely.</td>', 'In the center spire,  I would either show a little more detail or silhouette it entirely.', '2005-01-23 19:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127497, 135752, 489, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle.</td>', 'Interesting angle.', '2005-01-23 19:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127499, 136678, 489, '<td valign="top">I love the architecture but the sky is so unnatural and blown out I find it distracting. The colors in the building are fabulous though.</td>', 'I love the architecture but the sky is so unnatural and blown out I find it distracting. The colors in the building are fabulous though.', '2005-01-23 19:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127500, 137137, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice structure - good lead-in lines. Crop is a bit tight on the star.</td>', 'Nice structure - good lead-in lines. Crop is a bit tight on the star.', '2005-01-23 19:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127502, 136379, 489, '<td valign="top">Foreground clutter is somewhat distracting from an otherwise good shot.</td>', 'Foreground clutter is somewhat distracting from an otherwise good shot.', '2005-01-23 19:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127504, 137079, 489, '<td valign="top">Great angle and color contrast.</td>', 'Great angle and color contrast.', '2005-01-23 19:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127505, 136754, 489, '<td valign="top">Very cool building. I''ll be researching that name...</td>', 'Very cool building. I''ll be researching that name...', '2005-01-23 19:32:49.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1127506, 136782, 489, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and color.</td>', 'Nice perspective and color.', '2005-01-23 19:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127508, 136656, 489, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Even if this ends up not being in Iceland, it should be :-)</td>', 'Cool shot. Even if this ends up not being in Iceland, it should be :-)', '2005-01-23 19:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127509, 136920, 8860, '<td valign="top">Smart building. I can''t help feeling that your shot has not brought much creativity to the scene though. It''s at eye-level and it''s a nice day, but I''d like to have seen a viewpoint that offers more than just the subject itself for the impact.</td>', 'Smart building. I can''t help feeling that your shot has not brought much creativity to the scene though. It''s at eye-level and it''s a nice day, but I''d like to have seen a viewpoint that offers more than just the subject itself for the impact.', '2005-01-23 19:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127510, 135166, 489, '<td valign="top">Great use of reflection. My only criticism is the amount of overexposure on the upper left.  I love the creativity.</td>', 'Great use of reflection. My only criticism is the amount of overexposure on the upper left.  I love the creativity.', '2005-01-23 19:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127512, 137116, 489, '<td valign="top">Love the colors, love the lines.</td>', 'Love the colors, love the lines.', '2005-01-23 19:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127513, 136622, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great POV - intersting structure, with the people adding nice sense of scale (would have preferred them off-centre though). Good choice of centred comp to add strength.</td>', 'Great POV - intersting structure, with the people adding nice sense of scale (would have preferred them off-centre though). Good choice of centred comp to add strength.', '2005-01-23 19:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127516, 136768, 489, '<td valign="top">The branches iin the foreground intruding on the dome are distracting.</td>', 'The branches iin the foreground intruding on the dome are distracting.', '2005-01-23 19:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127518, 136944, 489, '<td valign="top">I lkike the simplicity of this and the smooth lines.</td>', 'I lkike the simplicity of this and the smooth lines.', '2005-01-23 19:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127519, 136700, 8860, '<td valign="top">Strong comp and nice weather. I like the contrast of materials in the old/new buildings.</td>', 'Strong comp and nice weather. I like the contrast of materials in the old/new buildings.', '2005-01-23 19:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127524, 136889, 489, '<td valign="top">I like it. Repeating elements on a large scale :-)</td>', 'I like it. Repeating elements on a large scale :-)', '2005-01-23 19:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127525, 136324, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - but the shapes are a bit too weak to offer much impact. Stronger sky colour would help too.</td>', 'Nice idea - but the shapes are a bit too weak to offer much impact. Stronger sky colour would help too.', '2005-01-23 19:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127532, 136188, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good use of wide-angle - obviously impressive structure too. Whites are a bit hot and image is slightly skewed. Very nice though, with plenty to look at.</td>', 'Good use of wide-angle - obviously impressive structure too. Whites are a bit hot and image is slightly skewed. Very nice though, with plenty to look at.', '2005-01-23 19:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127535, 136442, 489, '<td valign="top">I really think this would have more impact if it was straightened vertically - the exposure is great, and the colors as well.</td>', 'I really think this would have more impact if it was straightened vertically - the exposure is great, and the colors as well.', '2005-01-23 19:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127537, 137009, 28141, '<td valign="top">The centering and square crop make it a little dull.</td>', 'The centering and square crop make it a little dull.', '2005-01-23 19:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127539, 137220, 28141, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like the angle.  Not crazy about the shadow, but that''s hard to control.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like the angle.  Not crazy about the shadow, but that''s hard to control.', '2005-01-23 19:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127541, 137135, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nothing you could do about it but a blue sky would have helped alot. Good shot none the less.</td>', 'Nothing you could do about it but a blue sky would have helped alot. Good shot none the less.', '2005-01-23 19:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127549, 137249, 489, '<td valign="top">I love the repeating of the streetlights. good exposure, the clock face in the background is a tad hot but probably could not be helped.</td>', 'I love the repeating of the streetlights. good exposure, the clock face in the background is a tad hot but probably could not be helped.', '2005-01-23 19:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127551, 135917, 28141, '<td valign="top">I like the angle, but it seems overexposed at the top, which is the most interesting part of the building.  I don''t like the border.</td>', 'I like the angle, but it seems overexposed at the top, which is the most interesting part of the building.  I don''t like the border.', '2005-01-23 19:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127552, 137146, 8860, '<td valign="top">FLW can do little wrong in my eyes! Great looking building - nice time of day - but scene looks a little busy for me. A different, closer view may have afforded more interest as I find the tower quite distracting.</td>', 'FLW can do little wrong in my eyes! Great looking building - nice time of day - but scene looks a little busy for me. A different, closer view may have afforded more interest as I find the tower quite distracting.', '2005-01-23 19:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127554, 136994, 489, '<td valign="top">Crazy architecture!</td>', 'Crazy architecture!', '2005-01-23 19:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127555, 137089, 28141, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like the repetition and the person adds interest.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like the repetition and the person adds interest.', '2005-01-23 19:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127556, 137212, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of abstract. I''d have used the transform tool to straighten the verticals though. Soothing colour and tone.</td>', 'Nice choice of abstract. I''d have used the transform tool to straighten the verticals though. Soothing colour and tone.', '2005-01-23 19:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127557, 137108, 28141, '<td valign="top">Nice capture; I like the color.</td>', 'Nice capture; I like the color.', '2005-01-23 19:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127562, 135736, 489, '<td valign="top">You may be going for high key or something, but it really just looks overexposed to me.</td>', 'You may be going for high key or something, but it really just looks overexposed to me.', '2005-01-23 19:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127563, 137204, 489, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and sky.</td>', 'Great perspective and sky.', '2005-01-23 19:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127564, 136598, 28141, '<td valign="top">If the thing I''m looking at is indeed the house you''re talking about, I can barely see it.  It''s an impressive shot, very dramatic, but I don''t think it meets the challenge.</td>', 'If the thing I''m looking at is indeed the house you''re talking about, I can barely see it.  It''s an impressive shot, very dramatic, but I don''t think it meets the challenge.', '2005-01-23 19:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127566, 136729, 28141, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, make it bigger next time.</td>', 'Nice colors, make it bigger next time.', '2005-01-23 19:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127567, 137214, 8860, '<td valign="top">Like the use of the sun - wonderful shadow and a great structure. Not sure how I feel about the loss of the top - more/less crop would be better perhaps.</td>', 'Like the use of the sun - wonderful shadow and a great structure. Not sure how I feel about the loss of the top - more/less crop would be better perhaps.', '2005-01-23 19:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127570, 135696, 489, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Love the color, contrast and sense of age.</td>', 'Great shot. Love the color, contrast and sense of age.', '2005-01-23 19:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127571, 136884, 28141, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but the border is distracting.</td>', 'Nice image, but the border is distracting.', '2005-01-23 19:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127586, 136346, 8860, '<td valign="top">Creative viewpoint and mutli-faceted structure. Good shadows and I like the use of lens. Slight abherration at edges but this works well.</td>', 'Creative viewpoint and mutli-faceted structure. Good shadows and I like the use of lens. Slight abherration at edges but this works well.', '2005-01-23 19:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127587, 136900, 28141, '<td valign="top">Perhaps crop a little less off the bottom, but I like the texture the bricks give the image.</td>', 'Perhaps crop a little less off the bottom, but I like the texture the bricks give the image.', '2005-01-23 19:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127591, 135276, 8860, '<td valign="top">yes, nice. Good lines and detail. Sepia seems to denote sadness and gloom though, so I''m not sure that this is a good choice.</td>', 'yes, nice. Good lines and detail. Sepia seems to denote sadness and gloom though, so I''m not sure that this is a good choice.', '2005-01-23 19:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127592, 136968, 31403, '<td valign="top">have you tried taking one of the RGB channels for your black and white instead of just desaturating it?  Go back to your original color and just look at the channels and see what you think.  I think one of those channels would be more interesting in tone than just a desat.  <br/> <br/>Great shot though, I like it a lot.  You may catch flak for the curve in your lense, (I''ve seen it done), but in this case I think it adds to the whole "church'' theme.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge</td>', 'have you tried taking one of the RGB channels for your black and white instead of just desaturating it?  Go back to your original color and just look at the channels and see what you think.  I think one of those channels would be more interesting in tone than just a desat.   Great shot though, I like it a lot.  You may catch flak for the curve in your lense, (I''ve seen it done), but in this case I think it adds to the whole "church'' theme. Good luck in the challenge', '2005-01-23 19:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127594, 136877, 28141, '<td valign="top">Seems out of focus, makes the windows sortof unsettling.</td>', 'Seems out of focus, makes the windows sortof unsettling.', '2005-01-23 19:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127598, 137083, 8860, '<td valign="top">Love the subject. Good view too.</td>', 'Love the subject. Good view too.', '2005-01-23 19:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127602, 135999, 28141, '<td valign="top">The border is a bit much, but otherwise I like it.</td>', 'The border is a bit much, but otherwise I like it.', '2005-01-23 19:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127604, 137154, 25742, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The distortions really add a lot to this. I''d like to see more of the main building (the one which functions as a mirror). Good luck, you should be in the top 10, but I''m not good in reading the minds of the voters - if they have any :) /8</td>', 'Very nice. The distortions really add a lot to this. I''d like to see more of the main building (the one which functions as a mirror). Good luck, you should be in the top 10, but I''m not good in reading the minds of the voters - if they have any :) /8', '2005-01-23 20:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127605, 137168, 31403, '<td valign="top">replaced the sky with a solid color? I prefer a gradient.  I like the way the colors work together, it just doesn''t feel naturl. Really nice shot of the building -</td>', 'replaced the sky with a solid color? I prefer a gradient.  I like the way the colors work together, it just doesn''t feel naturl. Really nice shot of the building -', '2005-01-23 20:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127607, 136877, 25742, '<td valign="top">better focus would help IMO, the house is nice.</td>', 'better focus would help IMO, the house is nice.', '2005-01-23 20:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127608, 136992, 25742, '<td valign="top">Very good. I like this one, and it gets better the more I look at it. Good luck.</td>', 'Very good. I like this one, and it gets better the more I look at it. Good luck.', '2005-01-23 20:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127610, 137169, 8860, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene - emotive time of day. This will score highly for it''s out-of-challenge appeal too. Colours are lovely (looka bit like a gradient map - nice choice, if so). Great composition.</td>', 'Pretty scene - emotive time of day. This will score highly for it''s out-of-challenge appeal too. Colours are lovely (looka bit like a gradient map - nice choice, if so). Great composition.', '2005-01-23 20:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127611, 136327, 25742, '<td valign="top">one challenge too early :)</td>', 'one challenge too early :)', '2005-01-23 20:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127612, 135448, 28141, '<td valign="top">The MC Esher effect is very cool.  I think the image could be lit better though...you need to emphasize the sideways pig and bring out the colors of both the pigs and the wood.</td>', 'The MC Esher effect is very cool.  I think the image could be lit better though...you need to emphasize the sideways pig and bring out the colors of both the pigs and the wood.', '2005-01-23 20:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127614, 137120, 31403, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors, but I find myself wanting... more.</td>', 'beautiful colors, but I find myself wanting... more.', '2005-01-23 20:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127617, 137190, 31403, '<td valign="top">oh, I''m a sucker for symettry - I love it.</td>', 'oh, I''m a sucker for symettry - I love it.', '2005-01-23 20:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127618, 136798, 28141, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and angles, but I''m not crazy about the square crop or the border.</td>', 'I like the colors and angles, but I''m not crazy about the square crop or the border.', '2005-01-23 20:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127620, 137114, 31403, '<td valign="top">terrific framing</td>', 'terrific framing', '2005-01-23 20:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127623, 136749, 25742, '<td valign="top">that is one cool reflection you create there. I guess many ppl will miss that, because it''s so natural, you could have warned us in the title (1/2 planetarium). You should be in the top 10  - at least for me you are :) /9</td>', 'that is one cool reflection you create there. I guess many ppl will miss that, because it''s so natural, you could have warned us in the title (1/2 planetarium). You should be in the top 10  - at least for me you are :) /9', '2005-01-23 20:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127625, 136029, 25742, '<td valign="top">colourful, to say the least. what is this? office? residential?</td>', 'colourful, to say the least. what is this? office? residential?', '2005-01-23 20:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127626, 137120, 25742, '<td valign="top">focus too soft on lower floors.</td>', 'focus too soft on lower floors.', '2005-01-23 20:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127627, 134932, 28141, '<td valign="top">The brightness of the sky dominates over the architecture which would have been very interesting otherwise.</td>', 'The brightness of the sky dominates over the architecture which would have been very interesting otherwise.', '2005-01-23 20:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127628, 137098, 25742, '<td valign="top">cute, the red roof is so neat.</td>', 'cute, the red roof is so neat.', '2005-01-23 20:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127630, 137001, 28141, '<td valign="top">You need more light on the house.  Start by cropping out the driveway(?) in the forground...it distracts from the house since the snow is so bright.</td>', 'You need more light on the house.  Start by cropping out the driveway(?) in the forground...it distracts from the house since the snow is so bright.', '2005-01-23 20:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127631, 136754, 25742, '<td valign="top">Funny. Where is that and what is it?</td>', 'Funny. Where is that and what is it?', '2005-01-23 20:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
