(1127634, 136289, 25742, '<td valign="top">nice spire, moon good as well. I''m not so sure about the sepia, though.</td>', 'nice spire, moon good as well. I''m not so sure about the sepia, though.', '2005-01-23 20:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127637, 137049, 28141, '<td valign="top">The image is a little dark and the border is distracting.</td>', 'The image is a little dark and the border is distracting.', '2005-01-23 20:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127638, 137151, 25742, '<td valign="top">good title, and good capture of the moon.</td>', 'good title, and good capture of the moon.', '2005-01-23 20:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127641, 137069, 25742, '<td valign="top">OK, ég er með Perluna að utan, þú að innan. Hvort ætli virki betur :)<br/>I think longer shutter speed would be better for the fountain, to give it more character, and maybe also from the basement up, to show it''s size.</td>', 'OK, ég er með Perluna að utan, þú að innan. Hvort ætli virki betur :)I think longer shutter speed would be better for the fountain, to give it more character, and maybe also from the basement up, to show it''s size.', '2005-01-23 20:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127643, 135758, 25742, '<td valign="top">In my opinion a deeper DOF would suit this better.</td>', 'In my opinion a deeper DOF would suit this better.', '2005-01-23 20:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127644, 135926, 31403, '<td valign="top">great architecture, I''ve got to get to a rotunda and quick!<br/> <br/>It feels like the top of the rotunda is a little soft, and I admire the framing to minimize the blown out windows.  Really nice work.  7</td>', 'great architecture, I''ve got to get to a rotunda and quick! It feels like the top of the rotunda is a little soft, and I admire the framing to minimize the blown out windows.  Really nice work.  7', '2005-01-23 20:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127646, 136678, 31403, '<td valign="top">really nice exposure on the building, would Advance Edit let you replace the sky?  I''m kind of new here, so I don''t have all the rules down yet.<br/> <br/>Great perspective, I really like it.</td>', 'really nice exposure on the building, would Advance Edit let you replace the sky?  I''m kind of new here, so I don''t have all the rules down yet. Great perspective, I really like it.', '2005-01-23 20:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127650, 137149, 28141, '<td valign="top">It took me a long time to decide this is a mirror or strangely cut window pane (hope I''m right).  Unfortunately the way things are reflecting is more distracting and unsettling than it is interesting.  Those arches look interesting though.  I''d have shot an interesting angle on those and not bothered with the reflection.</td>', 'It took me a long time to decide this is a mirror or strangely cut window pane (hope I''m right).  Unfortunately the way things are reflecting is more distracting and unsettling than it is interesting.  Those arches look interesting though.  I''d have shot an interesting angle on those and not bothered with the reflection.', '2005-01-23 20:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
