(1127720, 136058, 18349, '<td valign="top">If the sky were not blown out and grey, this would be 100% stronger.  As it is, I wish there were a lot less sky and a lot more ground/wall/building in the foreground.  Any bright areas like the sky will bring the eye to them immediately, distracting them from the actual subject.  Keep shooting and experimenting, and be patient with weather and sky shots.  They will happen eventually!  This builidng with a beautiful blue sky and white puffy clouds will be most excellent!  :o)</td>', 'If the sky were not blown out and grey, this would be 100% stronger.  As it is, I wish there were a lot less sky and a lot more ground/wall/building in the foreground.  Any bright areas like the sky will bring the eye to them immediately, distracting them from the actual subject.  Keep shooting and experimenting, and be patient with weather and sky shots.  They will happen eventually!  This builidng with a beautiful blue sky and white puffy clouds will be most excellent!  :o)', '2005-01-23 20:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
