(1127891, 136884, 23913, '<td valign="top">great choice of boarder if u ever have to boarder an image u did this 1 right.<br/>it is a great pic. with lovely color. i would like it to be a little more leading however, it seems to me that the intent (of corse) was the building as the subject but at frist glance my eye see the entire thng as the subject a composed whole.<br/>normaly that would be great and this is a very nice post card shot but IMO there sould be more pop to the buildingit should take over in the image alittle more than it is now....all IMO...<br/> <br/>GL nice color if i did not mention that</td>', 'great choice of boarder if u ever have to boarder an image u did this 1 right.it is a great pic. with lovely color. i would like it to be a little more leading however, it seems to me that the intent (of corse) was the building as the subject but at frist glance my eye see the entire thng as the subject a composed whole.normaly that would be great and this is a very nice post card shot but IMO there sould be more pop to the buildingit should take over in the image alittle more than it is now....all IMO... GL nice color if i did not mention that', '2005-01-23 22:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127894, 135999, 6477, '<td valign="top">I like your concept very much, original and well done</td>', 'I like your concept very much, original and well done', '2005-01-23 22:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127896, 135752, 25464, '<td valign="top">This one will probably do very well because it is a different twist on the challenge.  I find the bit of dark tree reflection in the bottom right distracting. Otherwise, it is very nice.  I like the shadows shown on the columns.</td>', 'This one will probably do very well because it is a different twist on the challenge.  I find the bit of dark tree reflection in the bottom right distracting. Otherwise, it is very nice.  I like the shadows shown on the columns.', '2005-01-23 22:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127898, 137212, 25464, '<td valign="top">The lines and light here are very nice.  I think the color could have been bumped up a bit to improve.  Very good job though.</td>', 'The lines and light here are very nice.  I think the color could have been bumped up a bit to improve.  Very good job though.', '2005-01-23 22:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127901, 136159, 25464, '<td valign="top">I think this is a contender.  The composition is very interesting.  The tree reflections give an feeling very fitting to the title.  Great job.</td>', 'I think this is a contender.  The composition is very interesting.  The tree reflections give an feeling very fitting to the title.  Great job.', '2005-01-23 22:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
