(1127903, 137169, 25464, '<td valign="top">I think this is a beautiful image that is more about the environment than the architecture of a building.  It is beautiful though.</td>', 'I think this is a beautiful image that is more about the environment than the architecture of a building.  It is beautiful though.', '2005-01-23 22:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
