(1127909, 136547, 25464, '<td valign="top">I can certainly see why you chose this site.  I think you might have had more interesting angles to choose from here.  I am looking at the staircase in the background wondering if it would have made this more interesting.  Still very nicely done.</td>', 'I can certainly see why you chose this site.  I think you might have had more interesting angles to choose from here.  I am looking at the staircase in the background wondering if it would have made this more interesting.  Still very nicely done.', '2005-01-23 22:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
