(1127916, 137238, 25464, '<td valign="top">The black and white looks great here, but I think I would have cropped out the dark shadow in the bottom of the frame and focused in more on the more interesting features rather than trying to include the whole building.</td>', 'The black and white looks great here, but I think I would have cropped out the dark shadow in the bottom of the frame and focused in more on the more interesting features rather than trying to include the whole building.', '2005-01-23 22:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
