(1127919, 137135, 25464, '<td valign="top">The piece of missing sky is the downfall of this image.  The line, textures, colors, shadows, etc are all wonderful.</td>', 'The piece of missing sky is the downfall of this image.  The line, textures, colors, shadows, etc are all wonderful.', '2005-01-23 22:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
