(1127930, 137020, 1031, '<td valign="top">I haven''t been there since it was repaired -- looks great. Even though it would be small here, I think I''d have cropped to a 2:1 panorama to emphasize the building -- I don''t think it needs that much sky.</td>', 'I haven''t been there since it was repaired -- looks great. Even though it would be small here, I think I''d have cropped to a 2:1 panorama to emphasize the building -- I don''t think it needs that much sky.', '2005-01-23 22:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
