(1128006, 136475, 23913, '<td valign="top">nice grayscale.<br/>i wish this was shot with a fish eye though as it would add a round pull to the image and (for lack of a better word) push or beivel the doors at the viewer causing him or her to be litteraly sucked in with the impact of these mighty gothic doors.-GL</td>', 'nice grayscale.i wish this was shot with a fish eye though as it would add a round pull to the image and (for lack of a better word) push or beivel the doors at the viewer causing him or her to be litteraly sucked in with the impact of these mighty gothic doors.-GL', '2005-01-23 23:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128013, 136663, 8891, '<td valign="top">Watched you take this and I like it very much. Glad there is no frame. The passerby adds a nice perspective. I am not a fan of thin crops, but this works well to accentuate the repeated pattern of the arches. Much good luck, Jeremy. I hope it does well!  Mine sucks to high heaven so you should certainly have me beat.</td>', 'Watched you take this and I like it very much. Glad there is no frame. The passerby adds a nice perspective. I am not a fan of thin crops, but this works well to accentuate the repeated pattern of the arches. Much good luck, Jeremy. I hope it does well!  Mine sucks to high heaven so you should certainly have me beat.', '2005-01-23 23:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128019, 137158, 8891, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites in this challenge. Quite an expansive interior shot with great exposure and perfect detail. Like the angle you chose and your POV as it appears you were up a bit. I also like the inclusion of the student which is very effective in showing scale. Excellent work and good luck!</td>', 'This is one of my favorites in this challenge. Quite an expansive interior shot with great exposure and perfect detail. Like the angle you chose and your POV as it appears you were up a bit. I also like the inclusion of the student which is very effective in showing scale. Excellent work and good luck!', '2005-01-23 23:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128021, 137131, 8891, '<td valign="top">Steeples perhaps....depsite the title, this is very fine. I like the symmetry and the look of these against the muted tones of the sky.</td>', 'Steeples perhaps....depsite the title, this is very fine. I like the symmetry and the look of these against the muted tones of the sky.', '2005-01-23 23:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
