(1128465, 137005, 30364, '<td valign="top">Yep; I did notice the lens flare; it''s hard to miss.  Given the geometric character of the building, I decided on a whim to leave the big round blob(s) in; I even thought about how to accentuate them.  Not a universally popular decision!  Nearly as bad as the awful title.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-24 03:56:36.</i></td>', 'Yep; I did notice the lens flare; it''s hard to miss.  Given the geometric character of the building, I decided on a whim to leave the big round blob(s) in; I even thought about how to accentuate them.  Not a universally popular decision!  Nearly as bad as the awful title.', '2005-01-24 03:55:54.000000', '2005-01-24 03:56:36.000000', 0),
(1128492, 136912, 7263, '<td valign="top">And you say you don''t like Photoshop :D<br/> <br/>Missed this in voting - but it''s a cracker, superlative shot. Think maybe a tiny bit too unnatural (colrs) which is why it didn''t hit the top 3.<br/>Having said that, think it should have easily hit the top 10.<br/> <br/>Nice work.<br/> <br/></td>', 'And you say you don''t like Photoshop :D Missed this in voting - but it''s a cracker, superlative shot. Think maybe a tiny bit too unnatural (colrs) which is why it didn''t hit the top 3.Having said that, think it should have easily hit the top 10. Nice work. ', '2005-01-24 04:13:30.000000', NULL, 0),
