(1128719, 135276, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is incredible, Jason!</td>', 'This is incredible, Jason!', '2005-01-24 08:24:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1128729, 136976, 2634, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments everyone.<br/>Just to know, this was not taken with the challenge in mind.<br/>I was driving through NYC on a night where there was fog hanging in the skyscrapers.<br/>It had been hot the day before and turned cold. That day the fog was incredible.<br/> <br/>This shot was taken as i stuck half my body out the car window at the corner of 53rd and 3rd.<br/>I looked up and snapped and when i saw what was in the viewfinder i knew it was my shot of the evening.<br/> <br/>Yes it''s a little soft...well, you try hand holding out of a car at 1/10 sec. The noise, well i do wish i had my 20D that night...</td>', 'Thanks for the comments everyone.Just to know, this was not taken with the challenge in mind.I was driving through NYC on a night where there was fog hanging in the skyscrapers.It had been hot the day before and turned cold. That day the fog was incredible. This shot was taken as i stuck half my body out the car window at the corner of 53rd and 3rd.I looked up and snapped and when i saw what was in the viewfinder i knew it was my shot of the evening. Yes it''s a little soft...well, you try hand holding out of a car at 1/10 sec. The noise, well i do wish i had my 20D that night...', '2005-01-24 08:28:56.000000', NULL, 0),
