(1129134, 136122, 19978, '<td valign="top">Yeah, you were robbed. I doubt that the typical DPCer stopped to look more than a few seconds to critize cropping the house out. The composition as is shows a lot of attention to detail and the elements are are very well balanced in an understated sort of way. Beautiful colors and tones as well.</td>', 'Yeah, you were robbed. I doubt that the typical DPCer stopped to look more than a few seconds to critize cropping the house out. The composition as is shows a lot of attention to detail and the elements are are very well balanced in an understated sort of way. Beautiful colors and tones as well.', '2005-01-24 13:11:26.000000', NULL, 0),
