(1130157, 135276, 32449, '<td valign="top">Well-deserved ribbon.  Beautiful job!</td>', 'Well-deserved ribbon.  Beautiful job!', '2005-01-24 23:44:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1130158, 136944, 32449, '<td valign="top">I hoped this one would ribbon.. excellent job</td>', 'I hoped this one would ribbon.. excellent job', '2005-01-24 23:45:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1130159, 135999, 32449, '<td valign="top">I loved the choice of desat. with this.  Beautiful!</td>', 'I loved the choice of desat. with this.  Beautiful!', '2005-01-24 23:45:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1130166, 137149, 15360, '<td valign="top">This scored poorly but was perhaps one of the fun pictures I have captured.  I really enjoyed finding and taking this picture.<br/> <br/>I am outside a building on the sidewalk, looking through a glass window into an office.  The afternoon light is bright enough that the build across the street, and the pillar behind me is reflected in the window.  That the window is beveled glass made my attraction to this image even stronger.<br/> <br/>I''m not sure that if I stood inside the office, and shot through the window to the outside that the images would be similar.<br/> <br/>Thanks to all that voted, and especially those that commented.<br/>gw</td>', 'This scored poorly but was perhaps one of the fun pictures I have captured.  I really enjoyed finding and taking this picture. I am outside a building on the sidewalk, looking through a glass window into an office.  The afternoon light is bright enough that the build across the street, and the pillar behind me is reflected in the window.  That the window is beveled glass made my attraction to this image even stronger. I''m not sure that if I stood inside the office, and shot through the window to the outside that the images would be similar. Thanks to all that voted, and especially those that commented.gw', '2005-01-24 23:51:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1130196, 135999, 31717, '<td valign="top">What an awesome technique. I am assuming the bridge was not naturally discolored like that and that it is some wonderous trick with Photoshop that I can not even begin to think of.</td>', 'What an awesome technique. I am assuming the bridge was not naturally discolored like that and that it is some wonderous trick with Photoshop that I can not even begin to think of.', '2005-01-25 00:08:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(1130242, 135276, 772, '<td valign="top">Are you going to have a print available of this?  I''m willing to trade prints with you if interested...</td>', 'Are you going to have a print available of this?  I''m willing to trade prints with you if interested...', '2005-01-25 00:39:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1130254, 137131, 6172, '<td valign="top">Has a very unreal look to it.  Nice job, didn''t get a ribbon, but easily could have!</td>', 'Has a very unreal look to it.  Nice job, didn''t get a ribbon, but easily could have!', '2005-01-25 00:51:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1130285, 136944, 32157, '<td valign="top">WOW! that is one amazing piece of architecture.</td>', 'WOW! that is one amazing piece of architecture.', '2005-01-25 01:38:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1130304, 135276, 245, '<td valign="top">This picture rocks! Normally I think that the Brooklyn Bridge is one of the ugliest things ever designed by man, but you''ve managed to make it look great! Moody, gothic, and beautiful. Gold star!</td>', 'This picture rocks! Normally I think that the Brooklyn Bridge is one of the ugliest things ever designed by man, but you''ve managed to make it look great! Moody, gothic, and beautiful. Gold star!', '2005-01-25 01:54:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1130340, 136122, 17507, '<td valign="top">Here''s my input.<br/> <br/>I gave this a 7. I will get around to saying just why shortly. I think it''s a great picture, and its subtlety of tones set it apart from many of the other submissions. The curvature of the tree on the left holds the image together very nicely. In another challenge, say, a free study, I would probably have given this another point or two.<br/> <br/>But the reason I didn''t- and the reason I think that a lot of other people scored it so poorly- is that it''s really not a shot of architecture. It''s a shot that, technically, <i>includes</i> architecture, but the cottage doesn''t appear to have anything particularly impressive about its design, nor is the cottage itself even the dominant element in the picture. What I most notice, in order, are the window, the chimney, and the golden light on the grass in the background. Following that I find myself looking at the image as a whole, and noticing the play of light and the understated gradations of tone. By my reckoning, it simply doesn''t meet the challenge very well.<br/> <br/>Which is not to say it''s not a great picture- it is, to which your several sales attest.</td>', 'Here''s my input. I gave this a 7. I will get around to saying just why shortly. I think it''s a great picture, and its subtlety of tones set it apart from many of the other submissions. The curvature of the tree on the left holds the image together very nicely. In another challenge, say, a free study, I would probably have given this another point or two. But the reason I didn''t- and the reason I think that a lot of other people scored it so poorly- is that it''s really not a shot of architecture. It''s a shot that, technically, includes architecture, but the cottage doesn''t appear to have anything particularly impressive about its design, nor is the cottage itself even the dominant element in the picture. What I most notice, in order, are the window, the chimney, and the golden light on the grass in the background. Following that I find myself looking at the image as a whole, and noticing the play of light and the understated gradations of tone. By my reckoning, it simply doesn''t meet the challenge very well. Which is not to say it''s not a great picture- it is, to which your several sales attest.', '2005-01-25 02:35:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(1130680, 136598, 26045, '<td valign="top">Damn. I did not expect to see this all the way back here...I gave you a 7, and I loved this because:<br/> <br/>The architect is both man and god, and your photo is largely landscape with the very smallest house in the corner, and it spoke to me of a kind of insignificance, of a little house (oh, wow) as compared to this giant beautiful sky...it was very fitting. I love photos that can speak volumes to me. I thought maybe you could use this for your own purposes, maybe retitle it "The Architects" :)<br/> <br/>I am by no means religious, but I do see the obviousness of man vs nature, and I think you really captured the, uh, "size difference" here. Man is such a lightweight!<br/> <br/>So anyway, I obviously got into this photo and I''m really truly surprised others didn''t!<br/> <br/>Take care,<br/>Katy</td>', 'Damn. I did not expect to see this all the way back here...I gave you a 7, and I loved this because: The architect is both man and god, and your photo is largely landscape with the very smallest house in the corner, and it spoke to me of a kind of insignificance, of a little house (oh, wow) as compared to this giant beautiful sky...it was very fitting. I love photos that can speak volumes to me. I thought maybe you could use this for your own purposes, maybe retitle it "The Architects" :) I am by no means religious, but I do see the obviousness of man vs nature, and I think you really captured the, uh, "size difference" here. Man is such a lightweight! So anyway, I obviously got into this photo and I''m really truly surprised others didn''t! Take care,Katy', '2005-01-25 09:11:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1130685, 136512, 26045, '<td valign="top"><br/>I was really diggin'' the funky colors! Damn. Well, I gave you a 7, cuz I really like it.<br/> <br/>Take care,<br/>Katy<br/></td>', 'I was really diggin'' the funky colors! Damn. Well, I gave you a 7, cuz I really like it. Take care,Katy', '2005-01-25 09:15:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1130689, 136443, 26045, '<td valign="top"><br/>I''m one of your 10s! I loved the simplicity, of both the photo and the design. We''ve come a long way :)<br/> <br/>Take care,<br/>Katy</td>', 'I''m one of your 10s! I loved the simplicity, of both the photo and the design. We''ve come a long way :) Take care,Katy', '2005-01-25 09:19:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1130693, 136749, 26045, '<td valign="top"><br/>I''m one of your 10s. I loved this photo. It looks hot in BW, and it''s a great subject. What a building! You got a great angle for this photo, and I really enjoyed it.<br/> <br/>Take care,<br/>Katy</td>', 'I''m one of your 10s. I loved this photo. It looks hot in BW, and it''s a great subject. What a building! You got a great angle for this photo, and I really enjoyed it. Take care,Katy', '2005-01-25 09:23:27.000000', NULL, 0),
