(1131259, 135999, 3960, '<td valign="top">why would you leave the arrowhead shaped shadows running across the stantion.  with as much control as PS offers...they look like an ink trail from the days when we used to print photos on $89 printers.  also, the photo might be enhanced by using desat on the green patch, relagating it to the background (since it is not a main item).  great idea. thanks.</td>', 'why would you leave the arrowhead shaped shadows running across the stantion.  with as much control as PS offers...they look like an ink trail from the days when we used to print photos on $89 printers.  also, the photo might be enhanced by using desat on the green patch, relagating it to the background (since it is not a main item).  great idea. thanks.', '2005-01-25 16:12:04.000000', NULL, 0),
