(1168025, 135472, 8759, '<td valign="top">Background mountains are too strong contrasting with the rest of the picture. Then the trees that are framing i a certain way are also taking the eyes away from the bulding. It''s more nature than architecture. The building itself is nice but a little washed up and lacks contrast. I did not vote but it would be a 4 or 5.<br/>Ups! Silly me. Did not see the title. Makes more sense. But as Architecture remains as I commented!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-14 07:02:25.</i></td>', 'Background mountains are too strong contrasting with the rest of the picture. Then the trees that are framing i a certain way are also taking the eyes away from the bulding. It''s more nature than architecture. The building itself is nice but a little washed up and lacks contrast. I did not vote but it would be a 4 or 5.Ups! Silly me. Did not see the title. Makes more sense. But as Architecture remains as I commented!', '2005-02-14 06:57:21.000000', '2005-02-14 07:02:25.000000', 0),
