(1399230, 137106, 93, '<td valign="top">I love shots that defy convention.  This is one of those.  Great colors, focus and clarity again.  Good for you for going where few others dare tread with a simple and static subject.</td>', 'I love shots that defy convention.  This is one of those.  Great colors, focus and clarity again.  Good for you for going where few others dare tread with a simple and static subject.', '2005-05-19 19:43:31.000000', NULL, 0),
