(2446456, 136976, 48739, '<td valign="top">I was doing some research!! and i saw this one!! man this is awesome.....looks like a sen from Batman with the Riddler...lol Awesome shot!!</td>', 'I was doing some research!! and i saw this one!! man this is awesome.....looks like a sen from Batman with the Riddler...lol Awesome shot!!', '2006-05-22 13:18:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2497833, 136889, 53316, '<td valign="top">My first impression is that they''re leaning and in danger of falling over.    With that said, though, I love the buildings.  They are definitely very interesting to look at.  You also have a great color blue in the sky - mine always seem to come out all white - and I like how it changes to white at the bottom.  I like the space between the buildings, and how they are very similar but different in height and the larger band that the one on the right has.</td>', 'My first impression is that they''re leaning and in danger of falling over.    With that said, though, I love the buildings.  They are definitely very interesting to look at.  You also have a great color blue in the sky - mine always seem to come out all white - and I like how it changes to white at the bottom.  I like the space between the buildings, and how they are very similar but different in height and the larger band that the one on the right has.', '2006-06-08 04:54:27.000000', NULL, 0),
