(2658745, 137085, 56454, '<td valign="top">I really like the angles you chose for this shot.  Both the angle up and the tilt to the right work with the curves to create the feeling of motion.  The sharp lines break up the colors and create layers and depth.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I really like the angles you chose for this shot.  Both the angle up and the tilt to the right work with the curves to create the feeling of motion.  The sharp lines break up the colors and create layers and depth.  Nice shot.', '2006-07-25 14:25:30.000000', NULL, 0),
