(3436857, 135752, 67145, '<td valign="top">alice ... OMG.. OMG<b> ..WOW ...</b> this is the most awesome image ... i love abstract and this is both abstract AND realistic ... you are an amazing photographer ... i bought a polarizing filter a week ago and just about havent had it off the camera since ... love the effect it gives with those incredibly intense/deep blue skies ... love the colour contrasts in this image .. the blue and the brown of the columns .. love the dirt in the puddle creating a sort of frame ... just excellent ...</td>', 'alice ... OMG.. OMG ..WOW ... this is the most awesome image ... i love abstract and this is both abstract AND realistic ... you are an amazing photographer ... i bought a polarizing filter a week ago and just about havent had it off the camera since ... love the effect it gives with those incredibly intense/deep blue skies ... love the colour contrasts in this image .. the blue and the brown of the columns .. love the dirt in the puddle creating a sort of frame ... just excellent ...', '2007-03-07 08:00:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4552703, 137123, 52449, '<td valign="top">Arie, I really like how not only the sky/clouds in the center were exposed properly, but how you didn''t allow the walls to become silhouetted. It''s not everyday you get clouds like that in southern California. Excellent!</td>', 'Arie, I really like how not only the sky/clouds in the center were exposed properly, but how you didn''t allow the walls to become silhouetted. It''s not everyday you get clouds like that in southern California. Excellent!', '2008-03-10 16:08:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4923820, 135752, 69008, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful job of jiggling time and space to find something so wonderful to shoot.  I also like the saturation you achieved with the P filter.</td>', 'This is a beautiful job of jiggling time and space to find something so wonderful to shoot.  I also like the saturation you achieved with the P filter.', '2008-09-01 00:31:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6108196, 137247, 40718, '<td valign="top">Bellevue?!  When were you in Bellevue?  This building was one of the first I took pictures of way back when I had a EOS Rebel.  I went to Bellevue Christian from 7th to 9th grade.  This comment is free. ;)  The reflection is nice, but you need to, of course, lose the building at the bottom.</td>', 'Bellevue?!  When were you in Bellevue?  This building was one of the first I took pictures of way back when I had a EOS Rebel.  I went to Bellevue Christian from 7th to 9th grade.  This comment is free. ;)  The reflection is nice, but you need to, of course, lose the building at the bottom.', '2010-07-29 00:18:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6917412, 136524, 152252, '<td valign="top">Reflections of one building in the other, very nice... Nice colors too</td>', 'Reflections of one building in the other, very nice... Nice colors too', '2012-12-01 02:00:10.000000', NULL, 0),
